Thirty-one years in this room, child.'],['bea','You are the ninth boy they have told me is gifted.'],['ren','What happened to the other eight?'],['bea','Seven excellent surgeons. One accountant.'],['ren','I do not know if I am ready.'],['bea','He has glass in his arm. He cannot wait for ready.'],['ren','What if my hands shake?'],['bea','Then I will hold the tray.'],['ren','All right. Doctor Halloran. Scrubbing in.']]),\nS2:scene('S2','office','The hands and the nerves','comic',[\n ['bell','Our taxi driver is demanding a refund.'],['ren','For the operation?','wide'],['bell','For the taxi. Says the glass ruined the upholstery.'],['ren','He is going to be all right?'],['bell','You have the best hands I have ever seen, Doctor.'],['ren','Thank you, sir.'],['bell','And the worst nerves.'],['bea','The bucket can confirm that.'],['ren','I apologized to the bucket.'],['bell','Surgery is the art of being wrong slowly enough to fix it.'],['ren','That is not in the textbook.'],['bell','No publisher would take my textbook.'],['bea','Nor should they.'],['bell','Tomorrow you have a tumor. Routine, absolutely routine.'],['ren','Why does everyone say that twice?'],['bell','Sleep while the city lets you, Doctor.']]),\nS3:scene('S3','or','A routine audience','comic',[\n ['ren','Why is the entire board in the gallery?'],['bell','They enjoy observing excellence.'],['bea','They enjoy observing a budget being spent.'],['ren','I think I need the bucket again.'],['bea','It has tendered its resignation.'],['ren','Mrs. Ito lifts forty tons for a living.'],['bell','Today she only has to lie still.'],['ren','And I have to take that out of her.'],['bea','The mass, child. Not the crane.'],['ren','Right. Yes. I knew that.'],['bell','One incision. Control the bleeding. Remove the nodules.'],['ren','Three tethers on the image.'],['bea','Then count three on the tray.'],['bell','The room is yours, Doctor.'],['ren','Hana Ito, thirty-eight. Beginning the procedure.'],['bea','There. I knew the doctor was in there somewhere.']]),\nS4:scene('S4','or','A room without sound','sad',[\n ['ren','Everything went quiet.'],['bea','What did you say?','wide'],['ren','The alarms. The gallery. Even you.'],['ren','I could hear her heart. Nothing else.'],['bea','I have heard of that once.'],['ren','Is that a symptom?'],['bea','It is an operating-room story.'],['ren','Whose story?'],['bea','Someone who did not know when to stop listening.'],['ren','Bea. The specimen.'],['bea','Do not touch the tray.'],['ren','It is moving.'],['bea','I can see that.'],['ren','Seventy-six times a minute. Exactly.'],['bea','Tumors do not keep time, child.'],['pip','Doctor? Another envelope just arrived.']]),\nS5:scene('S5','lab','Chapter II · First Movement','tense',[\n ['pip','It is addressed to The Surgeon on Call.'],['ren','That could be anyone.'],['pip','It came with your photograph.'],['ren','That is less anyone.'],['pip','Listen. I played the notes on the chapel keyboard.'],['pip','It is a heartbeat, literally a heartbeat.'],['pip','Sixty-eight a minute with a skipped third.'],['pip','Who writes that? Who WRITES that?','wide'],['bea','Someone with too much time.'],['ren','The woman in the ambulance. She is a cellist.'],['pip','The slow movement. Adagio.'],['ren','There are lines on her liver. Five of them.'],['pip','A stave.'],['bea','And something between the lines.'],['ren','We are going to need a bigger specimen tray.'],['pip','Doctor, please do not let it finish the piece.']]),\nS6:scene('S6','ward','Below the hospital','villain',[\n ['sorrento','Welcome to Ward Zero.'],['ren','The hospital has no Ward Zero.'],['sorrento','Correct. Please remember that.'],['ren','What did I remove from that woman?'],['sorrento','A biological weapon, Doctor. Please wash your hands.'],['pip','REQUIEM. That is the label.'],['sorrento','Recombinant Endoparasitic Quiescent Immuno-Evasive Metazoan.'],['ren','You had that ready.'],['sorrento','We have had seventeen years to prepare the name.'],['bea','You have not had seventeen years to prepare the treatment.'],['sorrento','The Conservatory does not share its research.'],['ren','The Conservatory?'],['sorrento','Former students. A teacher. An unfinished composition.'],['ren','Who is the teacher?'],['bea','Not now, child.'],['sorrento','Your next patient is arriving by ferry.']]),\nS7:scene('S7','roof','A crossing in the rain','tense',[\n ['ren','Captain Castellano has not missed a crossing in nineteen years.'],['bea','Today he will.'],['ren','He asked me to call the harbor master.'],['bea','Did you?'],['ren','I told her he was indisposed.'],['bea','And?'],['ren','She said he had better be dying.'],['bea','Tell her we are working against that.'],['pip','The second score is shorter. Sharper.'],['pip','All these tiny flags. Staccato.'],['ren','There are holes in the scan.'],['bea','Then we close the holes.'],['ren','What if they keep opening?'],['bea','Then we keep closing them.'],['ren','You make it sound simple.'],['bea','No, child. I make it sound possible.']]),\nS8:scene('S8','or','The call','villain',[\n ['pip','Captain is stable. The ferry sent flowers.'],['ren','For him?'],['pip','For itself, apparently.'],['bea','Answer that phone, child.'],['ren','Operating Room Three. Doctor Halloran.'],['voss','Bravo, Doctor. You play by ear. How delightful.'],['ren','Who is this?'],['voss','Ask your nurse. She knows my timing.'],['bea','Cordelia.','wide'],['ren','Bea? The tray—'],['voss','Every heart is a metronome, Doctor.'],['voss','I merely gave them something to play.'],['ren','They are people.'],['voss','Yes. Such remarkable instruments.'],['bea','You died. I saw the certificate.'],['voss','Augustin always did have a beautiful signature.']]),\nS9:scene('S9','ward','Chapter III · Dissent','tense',[\n ['sorrento','Doctor Varga is here under supervision.'],['ines','He means armed supervision.'],['ren','You are from the Conservatory?'],['ines','I left. That is why I am breathing.'],['ren','We have a teacher with a chain in her brain.'],['ines','Your hands are excellent. Your diagnosis is a eulogy.'],['bea','Mind how you speak in my room.'],['ines','Then give me something useful to say. The scans.'],['ren','We could take our time. Stabilize first.'],['ines','Or sever the connections before they become vessels.'],['bea','Two doctors. Two plans. One patient.'],['ren','What does she want?'],['bea','She wants to see her class again.'],['ines','Then let us not keep them waiting.'],['ren','You are taking the lead?'],['ines','Try to learn something, Doctor.']]),\nS10:scene('S10','roof','The price of the quiet','sad',[\n ['ren','She taught you that. The way you move.'],['ines','She taught all of us.'],['ren','Did she have the Hush?'],['ines','She could hear a heart three rooms away.'],['ren','That sounds extraordinary.'],['ines','At the end, Doctor, you cannot turn it off.'],['ren','What happened in Ward Zero?'],['ines','A fire. A locked door. Seventeen patients.'],['ren','And the hospital called her dead.'],['ines','The hospital called it resolved.'],['ren','You could have told someone.'],['ines','I am telling you.'],['ren','I wait for the silence. It helps me think.'],['ines','He waits for the silence. I do not wait.'],['ren','Can we stop her?'],['ines','We can stop this patient dying. Begin there.']]),\nS11:scene('S11','office','For Augustin, who signed','tense',[\n ['bell','Surgery is much like running a hospital.'],['bea','Both require you to stop talking occasionally.'],['bell','The finest instrument is the—'],['ren','Sir?'],['bell','A curious pressure. Only that.'],['bea','AUGUSTIN\"'!'\"','wide'],['ines','No pulse. Get him on the trolley.'],['ren','There is an envelope in his jacket.'],['pip','For Augustin, who signed.'],['bea','Do not open that here.'],['pip','It is already open.'],['ines','His heart is following the score.'],['ren','Careful stabilization. We buy him time.'],['ines','An aggressive excision. We deny it time.'],['bea','Argue while you scrub, Doctors.'],['ren','We are bringing him home.']]),\nS12:scene('S12','corridor','The signature','sad',[\n ['bell','I signed her death certificate.'],['ren','You knew she was alive.'],['bell','I knew the hospital would close if the inquiry continued.'],['ines','You paid for these walls with her research.'],['bell','Every heart I mended here, I mended with her money.'],['ren','You cannot make that add up.'],['bell','I have tried for seventeen years.'],['bea','I handed her the knife for eleven.'],['ren','You knew it was her.'],['bea','I would know that silence anywhere.'],['bell','I thought I had saved the hospital.'],['ines','You gave her a rehearsal space.'],['pip','There is one more page.'],['ren','Whose name?'],['pip','No name. Just a rhythm I recognize.'],['bea','Go and get some sleep, all of you.']]),\nS13:scene('S13','or','Chapter IV · Coda','tense',[\n ['pip','I know this rhythm. It has a murmur.'],['pip','Ms. Okonkwo, you have got a—'],['bea','Forceps, ch—','sad'],['ren','BEA\"'!'\"','wide'],['ines','Ren. Look at me.'],['ren','Fifty-eight. No known allergies. She hates being called Beatrice.'],['ines','You cannot operate. You love her.'],['ren','Then you had better hand me the instruments.'],['pip','Her notebook. She left it on the trolley.'],['ren','Read it to me.'],['pip','“First, breathe. The patient is allowed to panic. You are not.”'],['ines','All three sites are compromised.'],['ren','Careful plan. We keep her stable.'],['ines','Aggressive plan. We end this before it learns her rhythm.'],['pip','“Whatever they tell you about gifted hands...”'],['ren','They still need someone to hold the tray. Scrubbing in.']]),\nS14:scene('S14','corridor','Dawn','sad',[\n ['pip','Her eyes are open.'],['ren','Bea?'],['bea','You held the forceps wrong, child.'],['ren','I know.'],['bea','You always do.'],['ren','I know.'],['bea','And you have not slept.'],['ines','None of us has.'],['bea','Then this room has three patients.'],['pip','Four. I swallowed the end of my pencil.'],['bea','Of course you did.'],['ren','Your notebook saved you.'],['bea','My notebook did not hold the instruments.'],['ren','The monitors are still in time. All of them.'],['ines','The conductor is still in the gallery.'],['bea','Then go and finish your shift, child.']]),\nS15:scene('S15','or','The first host','villain',[\n ['voss','You have altered the ending.'],['ren','We have stopped it.'],['voss','Stopped? Doctor, listen.'],['pip','The rhythm is coming from her.'],['ines','She is the first host.'],['voss','I could hear every one of them.'],['voss','Seventeen rooms. Seventeen hearts.'],['ren','You do not have to hear them now.'],['voss','If I stop conducting, what is left?'],['ren','A heartbeat.'],['sorrento','Let her go, Doctor.'],['ines','Ren. Her pulse is failing.'],['voss','No more music. Please.'],['sorrento','She made a weapon of this hospital.'],['ren','Open Operating Room Three.'],['ren','She is a patient.']]),\nS16:scene('S16','corridor','A second chance','calm',[\n ['pip','Mr. Pell used his turn signal. There were witnesses.'],['ren','A medical miracle.'],['ines','Mrs. Ito has asked you to stop visiting. Again.'],['ren','She sent a crane photograph.'],['pip','Class Four sent another card. Nobody drew any blood this time.'],['bell','The harbor orchestra is playing on Sunday.'],['ines','You will be in custody on Sunday.'],['bell','I have asked about an escort.'],['pip','And I have applied to nursing school.'],['bea','Then stop holding that pencil in your mouth.'],['ren','One last stitch. There.'],['bea','Good hands, child.','closed'],['ren','Thank you.'],['ines','There is someone at the door.'],['pip','An envelope. No return address.'],['voss','Opus Two.']])\n};\nexport const barks={\n start:['Gloves on. Breathe.','Your patient is waiting, Doctor.','Lamp down. Eyes up.'],\n nextPhase:['One thing at a time, child.','The next step is on your chart.','We are not finished.'],\n idle:['The patient is not an oil painting.','I have seen quieter hands on a clock.','Ask if you need me, child.'],\n vitalsLow:['Pressure is falling, child. Stabilizer.','The IV is there for a reason.','Look at the monitor, Doctor.'],\n vitalsCritical:['Stay with us. BOTH of you.','Her heart is asking a question. Answer it.','Stabilizer. NOW.'],\n miss:['That was not on the line.','I saw that. God saw that.','You will mend what you tear.','Eyes on the tip.'],\n streak:['…Adequate.','There is a surgeon under those nerves.','Keep that rhythm.','You may continue.'],\n bleeding:['You are swimming in it. Suction.','Clamp first. We need to see.','That vessel is not a fountain.'],\n overflow:['We have lost the field. Drain it.','Suction, child. Then heroics.','Less red. More seeing.'],\n clampReminder:['Your clamps are still in. Will you sign for them?','Count your instruments.','All of them come out.'],\n hushReady:['The room is listening. Are you?','Breathe in. Hold it. Now.','There is your quiet, child.'],\n timerLow:['Clock, child.','Time has no bedside manner.','Finish what you started.'],\n success:['Patient stable. Instruments counted.','Close the chart, Doctor.','Go and wash your hands.'],\n fail:['Call it. Then go and tell the family. No. You.','That is the job, child. Again.','Breathe. We can start this phase again.'],\n hint:['Read the next step. I wrote it in large letters.','The highlighted instrument, child.','Slow enough to see. Fast enough to save.'],\n toolHint:['The right instrument. The right pressure.','Your hands know what to do.','Steady does not mean still.'],\n strainIntro:['That is not anatomy.','Do not let it set the tempo.','A parasite with an education. How expensive.'],\n defib:['Clear the bed. Charge. Release in gold.','All hands away.','There is the beat. Bring it home.'],\n scanner:['Look under what you can see.','Hold the scanner still until it marks.','Nothing hidden stays hidden forever.'],\n notes:['My notebook. More time, less strain. A fair bargain.','A rank of B is still a living patient.','Take the help, child.']\n};\nexport function barkFor(event,tick=0){const a=barks[event]||barks.nextPhase;return a[Math.floor(tick/13)%a.length];}\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_23","type":"agent_message","text":"The first bot runs caught three blockers: task ordering prevented emergency cleanup, repeated chain attacks exhausted the clamps, and the boss kept attacking after losing its arms. Those are fixed. I’m building the operating room, characters, and interface next.\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_24","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\ntext=Path('../PLAN.md').read_text();sec=text.split('### 16.5 The ink filter')[1];code=sec.split('\"'```js'\"\\\\n')[1].split('\\\\n\"'```'\"')[0];Path('src/view/ink.js').write_text(code+'\\\\n')\nPY\ncat > src/view/materials.js <<'EOF'\nimport * as T from 'three/webgpu';\nconst d=new Uint8Array([95,95,95,255,165,165,165,255,235,235,235,255,255,255,255,255]);\nexport const ramp=new T.DataTexture(d,4,1,T.RGBAFormat);ramp.minFilter=ramp.magFilter=T.NearestFilter;ramp.needsUpdate=true;\nexport const toon=(color,opts={})=>new T.MeshToonNodeMaterial({color,gradientMap:ramp,...opts});\nexport const ink=toon('#120d20');\nexport const cream=toon('#f4f1e8');\nexport const metal=toon('#b6d8d5');\nexport function mesh(geo,mat,parent,x=0,y=0,z=0,scale){const m=new T.Mesh(geo,typeof mat==='string'?toon(mat):mat);m.position.set(x,y,z);if(scale)m.scale.set(...scale);m.castShadow=true;m.receiveShadow=true;parent?.add(m);return m;}\nexport function box(parent,color,x,y,z,w,h,d){return mesh(new T.BoxGeometry(w,h,d),color,parent,x,y,z);}\nexport function ball(parent,color,x,y,z,rx,ry=rx,rz=rx){return mesh(new T.SphereGeometry(1,24,16),color,parent,x,y,z,[rx,ry,rz]);}\nexport function tube(parent,color,points,r=.012){const c=new T.CatmullRomCurve3(points.map(p=>new T.Vector3(...p)));return mesh(new T.TubeGeometry(c,Math.max(12,points.length*6),r,7,false),color,parent);}\nexport function ring(parent,color,x,y,z,r,thick=.012){const m=mesh(new T.TorusGeometry(r,thick,8,64),color,parent,x,y,z);return m;}\nexport function labelTexture(text,{color='#f4f1e8',bg='transparent',size=100,font='700 44px \\\"Barlow Condensed\\\",sans-serif',width=512,height=128}={}){const c=document.createElement('canvas');c.width=width;c.height=height;const x=c.getContext('2d');if(bg\"'!=='\"'transparent'){x.fillStyle=bg;x.fillRect(0,0,width,height);}x.fillStyle=color;x.font=font;x.textAlign='center';x.textBaseline='middle';x.fillText(text,width/2,height/2,width-20);const tex=new T.CanvasTexture(c);tex.colorSpace=T.SRGBColorSpace;return tex;}\nexport function flatLabel(parent,text,x,y,z,w=1,h=.25,color='#f4f1e8'){return mesh(new T.PlaneGeometry(w,h),new T.MeshBasicNodeMaterial({map:labelTexture(text,{color}),transparent:true,depthWrite:false}),parent,x,y,z);}\nEOF\ncat > src/view/field.js <<'EOF'\nimport * as T from 'three/webgpu';\nimport {positionLocal,normalLocal,uniform,smoothstep,dot,normalView,normalize,vec3,max,positionWorld,mix,step,length,vec2} from 'three/tsl';\nimport {toon,mesh,box,tube,ball,ring} from './materials.js';\nexport function heightAt(kind,x,y){let h=.04;const g=(a,b,sx,sy,n)=>n*Math.exp(-((x-a)/sx)**2-((y-b)/sy)**2);\n if(kind==='forearm')h+=g(0,0,2,.55,.25);\n else if(kind==='heart')h+=g(-.28,.1,.6,.65,.37)+g(.35,-.1,.65,.65,.3);\n else if(kind==='liver')h+=g(-.5,0,.85,.65,.25)+g(.55,.1,.7,.5,.18)-g(.15,0,.1,.7,.05);\n else if(kind==='bowel')h+=.12+Math.sin(y*21+Math.sin(x*4)*2)*.055;\n else if(kind==='brain')h+=g(0,0,1.2,.8,.2)+Math.sin(x*23+Math.sin(y*14))*Math.sin(y*20)*.037;\n else if(kind==='lung')h+=g(-.55,0,.46,.7,.28)+g(.55,0,.46,.7,.28);\n else if(kind==='aorta')h+=g(0,.08,2,.24,.3);\n else h+=g(0,0,1.3,.75,.2);\n return h+.004*Math.sin(x*84+Math.sin(y*44))+.003*Math.sin(y*110+x*33);\n}\nconst siteColors={forearm:'#e2ae8a',abdomen:'#e4ac89',liver:'#b44356',bowel:'#ec8d9e',brain:'#edb7c7',heart:'#d44e65',lung:'#e994a2',aorta:'#d65368',stomach:'#e9a185'};\nexport function makeField(){const root=new T.Group(),surfaceGroup=new T.Group();root.add(surfaceGroup);\n const beat=uniform(0),scanner=uniform(new T.Vector3(10,0,10)),scanOn=uniform(0),scanRadius=uniform(.3);\n const canvas=document.createElement('canvas');canvas.width=canvas.height=1024;const ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');const texture=new T.CanvasTexture(canvas);texture.colorSpace=T.SRGBColorSpace;\n let kind='forearm',surface;\n const body=box(root,'#d3aa8c',0,-.08,0,3.45,.25,2.2);body.receiveShadow=true;\n const outer=new T.Shape();outer.moveTo(-3,-2);outer.lineTo(3,-2);outer.lineTo(3,2);outer.lineTo(-3,2);outer.closePath();const hole=new T.Path();for(let i=0;i<=100;i++){const a=-i/100*Math.PI*2,r=1+.025*Math.sin(a*7);const x=Math.cos(a)*1.43*r,y=Math.sin(a)*.87*r;if(\"'!i)hole.moveTo(x,y);else hole.lineTo(x,y);}outer.holes.push(hole);\n const drape=mesh(new T.ExtrudeGeometry(outer,{depth:.08,bevelEnabled:true,bevelSize:.035,bevelThickness:.035,bevelSegments:2,steps:1,curveSegments:80}),toon('\"'#17707a'),root,0,.33,0);drape.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;drape.receiveShadow=true;\n // Stitched binding around the fenestration, and fabric seams.\n const edge=[];for(let i=0;i<=100;i++){const a=i/100*Math.PI*2,r=1+.025*Math.sin(a*7);edge.push([Math.cos(a)*1.46*r,.39,-Math.sin(a)*.9*r]);}tube(root,'#103f49',edge,.025);\n for(let i=0;i<12;i++){const x=-2.8+i*.51;tube(root,i%2?'#1a6670':'#217781',[[x,.34,1.6],[x+.08,.36,1.3],[x+.14,.37,.95]],.006);}\n const tray=new T.Group();root.add(tray);box(tray,'#264953',1.69,.32,-.2,.64,.12,.94);box(tray,'#b8d5cf',1.69,.4,-.2,.6,.04,.9);for(const z of [-.68,.28])box(tray,'#7a9e9c',1.69,.46,z,.65,.08,.025);for(const x of [1.36,2.02])box(tray,'#87aaa5',x,.46,-.2,.025,.08,.95);\n const mat=toon('#ffffff',{map:texture});mat.positionNode=positionLocal.add(normalLocal.mul(beat.mul(.025)));\n const g1=smoothstep(.9935,.9945,dot(normalView,normalize(vec3(.22,.62,.75)))),g2=smoothstep(.9975,.998,dot(normalView,normalize(vec3(-.35,.5,.8))));mat.emissiveNode=vec3(1,.93,.9).mul(max(g1.mul(.85),g2.mul(.6)));\n mat.colorNode=mix(TSLTexture(),vec3(.08,.27,.34),step(length(positionWorld.xz.sub(scanner.xz)),scanRadius).mul(scanOn).mul(.78));\n function TSLTexture(){return undefined;}\n // Keep the texture through the material's standard map path; scanner is a separate disc.\n mat.colorNode=null;\n const scanDisc=mesh(new T.CircleGeometry(1,64),new T.MeshBasicNodeMaterial({color:'#22e8e5',transparent:true,opacity:.18,depthWrite:false}),root);scanDisc.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;scanDisc.visible=false;\n function reset(next){kind=next;ctx.fillStyle=siteColors[kind]||siteColors.forearm;ctx.fillRect(0,0,1024,1024);const grad=ctx.createRadialGradient(512,500,80,512,500,550);grad.addColorStop(0,'rgba(255,224,218,.12)');grad.addColorStop(1,'rgba(50,0,30,.22)');ctx.fillStyle=grad;ctx.fillRect(0,0,1024,1024);\n const rnd=(n)=>{const v=Math.sin(n*17.432)*4132.23;return v-Math.floor(v);};\n function branch(x,y,a,len,w,depth,index){if(depth<=0)return;const ex=x+Math.cos(a)*len,ey=y+Math.sin(a)*len;ctx.strokeStyle=kind==='forearm'?'rgba(120,65,74,.2)':'rgba(84,35,86,.38)';ctx.lineWidth=w;ctx.lineCap='round';ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(x,y);ctx.quadraticCurveTo(x+Math.cos(a+.3)*len*.6,y+Math.sin(a+.3)*len*.6,ex,ey);ctx.stroke();branch(ex,ey,a-.45+rnd(index)*.3,len*.64,w*.57,depth-1,index+1);branch(ex,ey,a+.5,len*.6,w*.55,depth-1,index+11);}\n for(let i=0;i<8;i++)branch(rnd(i+1)*1024,rnd(i+32)*1024,rnd(i+72)*6.28,110,6,4,i+1);\n if(kind==='bowel'||kind==='brain'){ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(111,27,68,.25)';ctx.lineWidth=5;for(let y=120;y<1000;y+=kind==='brain'?56:97){ctx.beginPath();for(let x=0;x<1024;x+=5){const yy=y+Math.sin(x*(kind==='brain'?.04:.015)+y*.02)*24;if(\"'!x)ctx.moveTo(x,yy);else ctx.lineTo(x,yy);}ctx.stroke();}}\n texture.needsUpdate=true;\n if(surface){surfaceGroup.remove(surface);surface.geometry.dispose();}\n const geo=new T.PlaneGeometry(3.6,2.5,180,130);geo.rotateX(-Math.PI/2);const p=geo.attributes.position;for(let i=0;i<p.count;i++)p.setY(i,heightAt(kind,p.getX(i),-p.getZ(i)));geo.computeVertexNormals();surface=mesh(geo,mat,surfaceGroup);surface.castShadow=false;surface.receiveShadow=true;\n }\n function paint(type,x,y){const cx=(x+1.8)/3.6*1024,cy=(1.25-y)/2.5*1024;ctx.fillStyle=type==='\"'scorch'?'rgba(73,25,56,.12)':type==='gel'?'rgba(124,242,201,.18)':'rgba(180,10,43,.45)';ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(cx,cy,type==='gel'?26:9,type==='gel'?26:3,0,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();texture.needsUpdate=true;}\n reset(kind);\n return{root,reset,paint,height:(x,y)=>heightAt(kind,x,y),update(s){beat.value=s.pulse||0;const seat=s.seats[0];scanDisc.visible=seat?.tool===6&&seat.use>0;if(scanDisc.visible){scanDisc.position.set(seat.x,heightAt(kind,seat.x,seat.y)+.05,-seat.y);scanDisc.scale.setScalar(.3);}}};\n}\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_24","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\ntext=Path('../PLAN.md').read_text();sec=text.split('### 16.5 The ink filter')[1];code=sec.split('\"'```js'\"\\\\n')[1].split('\\\\n\"'```'\"')[0];Path('src/view/ink.js').write_text(code+'\\\\n')\nPY\ncat > src/view/materials.js <<'EOF'\nimport * as T from 'three/webgpu';\nconst d=new Uint8Array([95,95,95,255,165,165,165,255,235,235,235,255,255,255,255,255]);\nexport const ramp=new T.DataTexture(d,4,1,T.RGBAFormat);ramp.minFilter=ramp.magFilter=T.NearestFilter;ramp.needsUpdate=true;\nexport const toon=(color,opts={})=>new T.MeshToonNodeMaterial({color,gradientMap:ramp,...opts});\nexport const ink=toon('#120d20');\nexport const cream=toon('#f4f1e8');\nexport const metal=toon('#b6d8d5');\nexport function mesh(geo,mat,parent,x=0,y=0,z=0,scale){const m=new T.Mesh(geo,typeof mat==='string'?toon(mat):mat);m.position.set(x,y,z);if(scale)m.scale.set(...scale);m.castShadow=true;m.receiveShadow=true;parent?.add(m);return m;}\nexport function box(parent,color,x,y,z,w,h,d){return mesh(new T.BoxGeometry(w,h,d),color,parent,x,y,z);}\nexport function ball(parent,color,x,y,z,rx,ry=rx,rz=rx){return mesh(new T.SphereGeometry(1,24,16),color,parent,x,y,z,[rx,ry,rz]);}\nexport function tube(parent,color,points,r=.012){const c=new T.CatmullRomCurve3(points.map(p=>new T.Vector3(...p)));return mesh(new T.TubeGeometry(c,Math.max(12,points.length*6),r,7,false),color,parent);}\nexport function ring(parent,color,x,y,z,r,thick=.012){const m=mesh(new T.TorusGeometry(r,thick,8,64),color,parent,x,y,z);return m;}\nexport function labelTexture(text,{color='#f4f1e8',bg='transparent',size=100,font='700 44px \\\"Barlow Condensed\\\",sans-serif',width=512,height=128}={}){const c=document.createElement('canvas');c.width=width;c.height=height;const x=c.getContext('2d');if(bg\"'!=='\"'transparent'){x.fillStyle=bg;x.fillRect(0,0,width,height);}x.fillStyle=color;x.font=font;x.textAlign='center';x.textBaseline='middle';x.fillText(text,width/2,height/2,width-20);const tex=new T.CanvasTexture(c);tex.colorSpace=T.SRGBColorSpace;return tex;}\nexport function flatLabel(parent,text,x,y,z,w=1,h=.25,color='#f4f1e8'){return mesh(new T.PlaneGeometry(w,h),new T.MeshBasicNodeMaterial({map:labelTexture(text,{color}),transparent:true,depthWrite:false}),parent,x,y,z);}\nEOF\ncat > src/view/field.js <<'EOF'\nimport * as T from 'three/webgpu';\nimport {positionLocal,normalLocal,uniform,smoothstep,dot,normalView,normalize,vec3,max,positionWorld,mix,step,length,vec2} from 'three/tsl';\nimport {toon,mesh,box,tube,ball,ring} from './materials.js';\nexport function heightAt(kind,x,y){let h=.04;const g=(a,b,sx,sy,n)=>n*Math.exp(-((x-a)/sx)**2-((y-b)/sy)**2);\n if(kind==='forearm')h+=g(0,0,2,.55,.25);\n else if(kind==='heart')h+=g(-.28,.1,.6,.65,.37)+g(.35,-.1,.65,.65,.3);\n else if(kind==='liver')h+=g(-.5,0,.85,.65,.25)+g(.55,.1,.7,.5,.18)-g(.15,0,.1,.7,.05);\n else if(kind==='bowel')h+=.12+Math.sin(y*21+Math.sin(x*4)*2)*.055;\n else if(kind==='brain')h+=g(0,0,1.2,.8,.2)+Math.sin(x*23+Math.sin(y*14))*Math.sin(y*20)*.037;\n else if(kind==='lung')h+=g(-.55,0,.46,.7,.28)+g(.55,0,.46,.7,.28);\n else if(kind==='aorta')h+=g(0,.08,2,.24,.3);\n else h+=g(0,0,1.3,.75,.2);\n return h+.004*Math.sin(x*84+Math.sin(y*44))+.003*Math.sin(y*110+x*33);\n}\nconst siteColors={forearm:'#e2ae8a',abdomen:'#e4ac89',liver:'#b44356',bowel:'#ec8d9e',brain:'#edb7c7',heart:'#d44e65',lung:'#e994a2',aorta:'#d65368',stomach:'#e9a185'};\nexport function makeField(){const root=new T.Group(),surfaceGroup=new T.Group();root.add(surfaceGroup);\n const beat=uniform(0),scanner=uniform(new T.Vector3(10,0,10)),scanOn=uniform(0),scanRadius=uniform(.3);\n const canvas=document.createElement('canvas');canvas.width=canvas.height=1024;const ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');const texture=new T.CanvasTexture(canvas);texture.colorSpace=T.SRGBColorSpace;\n let kind='forearm',surface;\n const body=box(root,'#d3aa8c',0,-.08,0,3.45,.25,2.2);body.receiveShadow=true;\n const outer=new T.Shape();outer.moveTo(-3,-2);outer.lineTo(3,-2);outer.lineTo(3,2);outer.lineTo(-3,2);outer.closePath();const hole=new T.Path();for(let i=0;i<=100;i++){const a=-i/100*Math.PI*2,r=1+.025*Math.sin(a*7);const x=Math.cos(a)*1.43*r,y=Math.sin(a)*.87*r;if(\"'!i)hole.moveTo(x,y);else hole.lineTo(x,y);}outer.holes.push(hole);\n const drape=mesh(new T.ExtrudeGeometry(outer,{depth:.08,bevelEnabled:true,bevelSize:.035,bevelThickness:.035,bevelSegments:2,steps:1,curveSegments:80}),toon('\"'#17707a'),root,0,.33,0);drape.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;drape.receiveShadow=true;\n // Stitched binding around the fenestration, and fabric seams.\n const edge=[];for(let i=0;i<=100;i++){const a=i/100*Math.PI*2,r=1+.025*Math.sin(a*7);edge.push([Math.cos(a)*1.46*r,.39,-Math.sin(a)*.9*r]);}tube(root,'#103f49',edge,.025);\n for(let i=0;i<12;i++){const x=-2.8+i*.51;tube(root,i%2?'#1a6670':'#217781',[[x,.34,1.6],[x+.08,.36,1.3],[x+.14,.37,.95]],.006);}\n const tray=new T.Group();root.add(tray);box(tray,'#264953',1.69,.32,-.2,.64,.12,.94);box(tray,'#b8d5cf',1.69,.4,-.2,.6,.04,.9);for(const z of [-.68,.28])box(tray,'#7a9e9c',1.69,.46,z,.65,.08,.025);for(const x of [1.36,2.02])box(tray,'#87aaa5',x,.46,-.2,.025,.08,.95);\n const mat=toon('#ffffff',{map:texture});mat.positionNode=positionLocal.add(normalLocal.mul(beat.mul(.025)));\n const g1=smoothstep(.9935,.9945,dot(normalView,normalize(vec3(.22,.62,.75)))),g2=smoothstep(.9975,.998,dot(normalView,normalize(vec3(-.35,.5,.8))));mat.emissiveNode=vec3(1,.93,.9).mul(max(g1.mul(.85),g2.mul(.6)));\n mat.colorNode=mix(TSLTexture(),vec3(.08,.27,.34),step(length(positionWorld.xz.sub(scanner.xz)),scanRadius).mul(scanOn).mul(.78));\n function TSLTexture(){return undefined;}\n // Keep the texture through the material's standard map path; scanner is a separate disc.\n mat.colorNode=null;\n const scanDisc=mesh(new T.CircleGeometry(1,64),new T.MeshBasicNodeMaterial({color:'#22e8e5',transparent:true,opacity:.18,depthWrite:false}),root);scanDisc.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;scanDisc.visible=false;\n function reset(next){kind=next;ctx.fillStyle=siteColors[kind]||siteColors.forearm;ctx.fillRect(0,0,1024,1024);const grad=ctx.createRadialGradient(512,500,80,512,500,550);grad.addColorStop(0,'rgba(255,224,218,.12)');grad.addColorStop(1,'rgba(50,0,30,.22)');ctx.fillStyle=grad;ctx.fillRect(0,0,1024,1024);\n const rnd=(n)=>{const v=Math.sin(n*17.432)*4132.23;return v-Math.floor(v);};\n function branch(x,y,a,len,w,depth,index){if(depth<=0)return;const ex=x+Math.cos(a)*len,ey=y+Math.sin(a)*len;ctx.strokeStyle=kind==='forearm'?'rgba(120,65,74,.2)':'rgba(84,35,86,.38)';ctx.lineWidth=w;ctx.lineCap='round';ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(x,y);ctx.quadraticCurveTo(x+Math.cos(a+.3)*len*.6,y+Math.sin(a+.3)*len*.6,ex,ey);ctx.stroke();branch(ex,ey,a-.45+rnd(index)*.3,len*.64,w*.57,depth-1,index+1);branch(ex,ey,a+.5,len*.6,w*.55,depth-1,index+11);}\n for(let i=0;i<8;i++)branch(rnd(i+1)*1024,rnd(i+32)*1024,rnd(i+72)*6.28,110,6,4,i+1);\n if(kind==='bowel'||kind==='brain'){ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(111,27,68,.25)';ctx.lineWidth=5;for(let y=120;y<1000;y+=kind==='brain'?56:97){ctx.beginPath();for(let x=0;x<1024;x+=5){const yy=y+Math.sin(x*(kind==='brain'?.04:.015)+y*.02)*24;if(\"'!x)ctx.moveTo(x,yy);else ctx.lineTo(x,yy);}ctx.stroke();}}\n texture.needsUpdate=true;\n if(surface){surfaceGroup.remove(surface);surface.geometry.dispose();}\n const geo=new T.PlaneGeometry(3.6,2.5,180,130);geo.rotateX(-Math.PI/2);const p=geo.attributes.position;for(let i=0;i<p.count;i++)p.setY(i,heightAt(kind,p.getX(i),-p.getZ(i)));geo.computeVertexNormals();surface=mesh(geo,mat,surfaceGroup);surface.castShadow=false;surface.receiveShadow=true;\n }\n function paint(type,x,y){const cx=(x+1.8)/3.6*1024,cy=(1.25-y)/2.5*1024;ctx.fillStyle=type==='\"'scorch'?'rgba(73,25,56,.12)':type==='gel'?'rgba(124,242,201,.18)':'rgba(180,10,43,.45)';ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(cx,cy,type==='gel'?26:9,type==='gel'?26:3,0,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();texture.needsUpdate=true;}\n reset(kind);\n return{root,reset,paint,height:(x,y)=>heightAt(kind,x,y),update(s){beat.value=s.pulse||0;const seat=s.seats[0];scanDisc.visible=seat?.tool===6&&seat.use>0;if(scanDisc.visible){scanDisc.position.set(seat.x,heightAt(kind,seat.x,seat.y)+.05,-seat.y);scanDisc.scale.setScalar(.3);}}};\n}\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_25","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('src/view/field.js');s=p.read_text();a=s.index(' mat.colorNode=mix');b=s.index(' const scanDisc',a);s=s[:a]+s[b:];p.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat > src/view/bust.js <<'EOF'\nimport * as T from 'three/webgpu';\nimport {cast} from '../data/cast.js';\nimport {mesh,ball,tube,box,ring,toon} from './materials.js';\nexport function createBust(id='ren',overrides={}){\n const spec={...(cast[id]||cast.ren),...overrides};const root=new T.Group(),body=new T.Group(),head=new T.Group();body.name='Body';head.name='Head';root.add(body);root.add(head);\n const skin=spec.skin||'#d8a589',hair=spec.hair||'#293640',clothes=spec.coat||'#17707a';\n const canvas=document.createElement('canvas');canvas.width=1024;canvas.height=512;const ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');const tex=new T.CanvasTexture(canvas);tex.colorSpace=T.SRGBColorSpace;\n let mood='neutral',mouth=0;\n function draw(){ctx.fillStyle=skin;ctx.fillRect(0,0,1024,512);const eyeY=mood==='wide'?225:232;for(const side of [-1,1]){const x=256+side*62;ctx.fillStyle='#aa665a';ctx.globalAlpha=.24;ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(x,284,27,7,0,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();ctx.globalAlpha=1;\n const ry=mood==='closed'?3:mood==='narrow'?13:25;\n ctx.fillStyle='#fffaf2';ctx.strokeStyle='#21162a';ctx.lineWidth=5;ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(x,eyeY,30,ry,-side*.1,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();ctx.stroke();\n if(mood\"'!=='\"'closed'){const grad=ctx.createLinearGradient(0,eyeY-20,0,eyeY+20);grad.addColorStop(0,'#11142b');grad.addColorStop(.5,spec.eyes||'#3b7578');grad.addColorStop(1,'#b0e8db');ctx.fillStyle=grad;ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(x,eyeY,15,Math.max(9,ry-3),0,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();ctx.fillStyle='#10111e';ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(x,eyeY-2,7,Math.max(8,ry-5),0,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();ctx.fillStyle='#fff';ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(x-5,eyeY-9,6,5,0,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(x+5,eyeY+7,2.5,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();}\n ctx.strokeStyle=hair;ctx.lineWidth=8;ctx.lineCap='round';ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(x-27,eyeY-40+(mood==='sad'?side*5:0));ctx.lineTo(x+27,eyeY-42+(mood==='narrow'?side*10:0));ctx.stroke();}\n ctx.strokeStyle='#92554e';ctx.lineWidth=3;ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(253,270);ctx.lineTo(246,292);ctx.lineTo(258,296);ctx.stroke();\n ctx.fillStyle='#6b3342';ctx.strokeStyle='#623444';ctx.lineWidth=3;ctx.beginPath();if(mouth){ctx.ellipse(256,334,14+mouth*3,6+mouth*5,0,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();ctx.fillStyle='#efb0a7';ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(256,340+mouth*2,11,3,0,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();}else{ctx.moveTo(235,329);ctx.quadraticCurveTo(255,mood==='sad'?320:340,277,328);ctx.stroke();}\n if(id==='ines'){ctx.strokeStyle='#9f6766';ctx.lineWidth=4;ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(172,166);ctx.lineTo(194,223);ctx.stroke();}\n if(['bell','voss'].includes(id)||overrides.age>55){ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(80,40,35,.35)';ctx.lineWidth=2;for(const side of [-1,1]){ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(256+side*95,237);ctx.lineTo(256+side*112,247);ctx.stroke();}}\n if(mood==='wide'&&id==='ren'){ctx.fillStyle='#a6e4ef';ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(125,215,6,18,.3,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();}\n tex.needsUpdate=true;}\n const geo=new T.SphereGeometry(1,64,48),p=geo.attributes.position;for(let i=0;i<p.count;i++){let x=p.getX(i),y=p.getY(i),z=p.getZ(i);if(y<0){let t=-y,jaw=t>.25?((t-.25)/.75)**1.4:0;x*=1-.1*t-.42*jaw;z*=1-.12*t;z+=.05*t*t;y*=1+.16*t;}p.setXYZ(i,x,y,z*.94);}geo.computeVertexNormals();mesh(geo,toon('#ffffff',{map:tex}),head);\n mesh(new T.CylinderGeometry(.36,.44,.7,20),skin,body,0,-1.18,0);\n const points=[[.34,.9],[.55,.82],[1.5,.52],[1.95,.05],[2.08,-.8],[2.1,-2.2]].map(([r,y])=>new T.Vector2(r,y));const torso=mesh(new T.LatheGeometry(points,40),clothes,body,0,-2.08,0);torso.scale.z=.62;\n const collarMat=toon(id==='ines'?'#414350':'#d8efe4');for(const side of [-1,1]){const collar=box(body,collarMat,side*.37,-1.61,.58,.22,.72,.06);collar.rotation.z=side*.55;}\n if(id==='ren'||id==='bell'){for(const side of [-1,1]){const lapel=box(body,'#fbf4df',side*.63,-1.9,.73,.44,1.25,.08);lapel.rotation.z=side*.23;}tube(body,'#20333c',[[-.47,-1.25,.59],[-.65,-1.8,.9],[-.43,-2.3,.97],[.32,-2.33,.98],[.55,-1.6,.8],[.42,-1.25,.55]],.05);ball(body,'#97b3b0',.35,-2.3,1.03,.12,.12,.035);}\n if(id==='bell'){for(const side of [-1,1]){const bow=mesh(new T.ConeGeometry(.23,.4,3),'#91344a',body,side*.18,-1.5,.71);bow.rotation.z=side*Math.PI/2;const m=ball(head,'#f5ecd8',side*.29,-.44,.86,.38,.13,.12);m.rotation.z=-side*.15;}ball(head,'#f2e3cc',0,-.42,.92,.11,.11,.08);}\n if(spec.style\"'!=='\"'bald'){\n const cap=mesh(new T.SphereGeometry(1.06,40,24,0,Math.PI*2,0,Math.PI*.49),hair,head,0,.035,0);\n if(['bob','long','slick'].includes(spec.style)){const back=ball(head,hair,0,-.05,-.31,1.05,spec.style==='long'?1.5:1.08,.78);if(spec.style==='long')back.position.y=-.5;}\n if(spec.style\"'!=='\"'wrap')for(let i=0;i<19;i++){const a=i/18*Math.PI,x=Math.cos(a)*.91,y=.58+Math.sin(a)*.15,z=.52+Math.sin(a)*.24;const len=spec.style==='spiky'?.36+(i%3)*.12:spec.style==='bob'?.58:.32;const lock=mesh(new T.ConeGeometry(.19,len,5),hair,head,x,y,z);lock.rotation.z=Math.PI+(i-9)*.055;lock.rotation.x=.23;}\n if(spec.style==='bob'){box(head,'#e4e6df',.48,.48,.75,.12,.61,.08).rotation.z=-.14;for(const side of [-1,1])ball(head,hair,side*.9,-.3,.1,.21,.63,.35);}\n if(spec.style==='buns')for(const side of [-1,1]){ball(head,hair,side*.83,.83,-.13,.38,.37,.35);ring(head,'#eac157',side*.82,.74,.1,.27,.035);}\n }\n if(spec.style==='wrap'){for(let i=0;i<5;i++)ball(head,i%2?'#edaa29':'#f9c24a',0,.63+i*.08,-.02,1.08-i*.09,.35,.88-i*.04);ball(head,'#bfc3b9',0,.48,-.75,.57,.55,.4);const knot=ball(head,'#f2b134',-.65,.85,.25,.31,.45,.3);knot.rotation.z=.55;}\n if(['bea','sorrento'].includes(id)||spec.style==='wrap'){for(const side of [-1,1])ring(head,'#17252b',side*.36,.04,.91,.27,.033);tube(head,'#17252b',[[-.09,.04,.95],[0,.07,.98],[.09,.04,.95]],.023);}\n // Pens, pocket and hospital badge make the silhouette read as a clinician.\n box(body,'#e7e5ce',-.8,-2.2,.91,.36,.36,.055);box(body,'#e6ac3a',-.8,-2.14,.95,.25,.08,.025);for(let i=0;i<2;i++)box(body,i?'#e6b954':'#7ce3d2',.8+i*.09,-1.9,.93,.045,.38,.04);\n const mixer=new T.AnimationMixer(root),clips={};\n const add=(name,times,values,path,loop=false)=>{const clip=new T.AnimationClip(name,times.at(-1),[new T.NumberKeyframeTrack(path,times,values)]);const a=mixer.clipAction(clip);a.setLoop(loop?T.LoopRepeat:T.LoopOnce,loop?Infinity:1);a.clampWhenFinished=\"'!loop;clips[name]=a;};\n add('\"'idle',[0,1.6,3.2],[0,.018,0],'Body.rotation[z]',true);clips.idle.play();\n for(const [name,values] of Object.entries({nod:[0,.16,-.08,0],shake:[0,.17,-.17,0],shock:[0,-.25,-.1,0],lean:[0,.16,.16,0],sigh:[0,.1,.12,0],bow:[0,.3,.3,0],slump:[0,.3,.3,.3],collapse:[0,.3,1.1,1.7]}))add(name,[0,.16,.45,.8],values,\"'`Head.rotation[${name==='\"'shake'?'y':'x'}]\"'`);\n draw();return{root,spec,mixer,clips,expression(m){if(m!==mood){mood=m;draw();}},talk(n){n=Math.floor(n)%4;if(n!==mouth){mouth=n;draw();}},animate(name){clips[name]?.reset().play();},update(dt){mixer.update(dt);},dispose(){tex.dispose();}};\n}\nEOF\ncat > src/view/instruments.js <<'\"'EOF'\nimport * as T from 'three/webgpu';\nimport {mesh,ball,box,tube,ring,toon} from './materials.js';\nexport function createInstrument(tool){const root=new T.Group(),pivot=new T.Group();root.add(pivot);pivot.name='Tool';pivot.rotation.z=-.65;pivot.rotation.x=.4;\n const steel=toon('#b7d9d2'),dark=toon('#183c49'),grip=toon(tool===5?'#653747':tool===3?'#46bdab':'#358799');\n const rod=(x,z,l=.4,r=.018)=>mesh(new T.CylinderGeometry(r,r*.8,l,10),steel,pivot,x,l/2+.03,z);\n const jaws=[];\n if(tool===0){rod(0,0,.35,.025);const blade=mesh(new T.ConeGeometry(.038,.18,3),'#edf6e3',pivot,0,.015,0);blade.rotation.z=Math.PI;box(pivot,dark,0,.34,0,.055,.18,.04);}\n else if(tool===1||tool===7||tool===4){for(const side of [-1,1]){const jaw=new T.Group();jaw.name=side===1?'JawR':'JawL';jaw.position.x=side*.012;pivot.add(jaw);rod.call(null);tube(jaw,steel,[[side*.004,.0,0],[side*.035,.15,0],[side*.045,.38,0]],tool===7?.018:.012);ring(jaw,grip,side*.045,.4,0,.045,.009);jaws.push(jaw);}if(tool===4)tube(pivot,'#edf1e1',[[0,0,0],[.06,-.03,0],[.08,-.1,0],[.02,-.12,0]],.009);}\n else if(tool===6){rod(0,0,.32,.023);const disc=mesh(new T.CylinderGeometry(.08,.065,.035,32),dark,pivot,0,.02,0);ring(pivot,'#53eeee',0,0,.022,.062,.007).rotation.x=Math.PI/2;box(pivot,'#b8e9df',0,.28,0,.07,.16,.055);}\n else {rod(0,0,.35,.022);box(pivot,grip,0,.28,0,.065,.24,.06);if(tool===2)tube(pivot,'#1b414f',[[0,.4,0],[.08,.5,.03],[.17,.48,.14],[.26,.51,.26]],.018);if(tool===3)ball(pivot,'#a9ffe0',0,.15,0,.06,.12,.05);if(tool===5)ball(pivot,'#f36998',0,0,0,.025);}\n const mixer=new T.AnimationMixer(root);const clip=new T.AnimationClip('use',.3,[new T.NumberKeyframeTrack('Tool.position[y]',[0,.12,.3],[0,-.025,0])]);const action=mixer.clipAction(clip);action.play();action.paused=true;\n return{root,update(dt,use){action.paused=\"'!use;mixer.update(dt);for(let i=0;i<jaws.length;i++)jaws[i].rotation.z=(i?1:-1)*(use?.02:.09);}};\n}\nexport function makePaddles(){const root=new T.Group();for(const side of [-1,1]){const p=new T.Group();p.name=side===1?'\"'RightPaddle':'LeftPaddle';p.position.set(side*.65,.3,0);box(p,'#ced8ce',0,0,0,.36,.06,.3);box(p,'#d9b43e',0,.09,0,.22,.13,.12);tube(p,'#21333b',[[0,.1,0],[side*.2,.15,.2],[side*.4,.12,.3]],.025);root.add(p);}return root;}\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_25","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('src/view/field.js');s=p.read_text();a=s.index(' mat.colorNode=mix');b=s.index(' const scanDisc',a);s=s[:a]+s[b:];p.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat > src/view/bust.js <<'EOF'\nimport * as T from 'three/webgpu';\nimport {cast} from '../data/cast.js';\nimport {mesh,ball,tube,box,ring,toon} from './materials.js';\nexport function createBust(id='ren',overrides={}){\n const spec={...(cast[id]||cast.ren),...overrides};const root=new T.Group(),body=new T.Group(),head=new T.Group();body.name='Body';head.name='Head';root.add(body);root.add(head);\n const skin=spec.skin||'#d8a589',hair=spec.hair||'#293640',clothes=spec.coat||'#17707a';\n const canvas=document.createElement('canvas');canvas.width=1024;canvas.height=512;const ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');const tex=new T.CanvasTexture(canvas);tex.colorSpace=T.SRGBColorSpace;\n let mood='neutral',mouth=0;\n function draw(){ctx.fillStyle=skin;ctx.fillRect(0,0,1024,512);const eyeY=mood==='wide'?225:232;for(const side of [-1,1]){const x=256+side*62;ctx.fillStyle='#aa665a';ctx.globalAlpha=.24;ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(x,284,27,7,0,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();ctx.globalAlpha=1;\n const ry=mood==='closed'?3:mood==='narrow'?13:25;\n ctx.fillStyle='#fffaf2';ctx.strokeStyle='#21162a';ctx.lineWidth=5;ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(x,eyeY,30,ry,-side*.1,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();ctx.stroke();\n if(mood\"'!=='\"'closed'){const grad=ctx.createLinearGradient(0,eyeY-20,0,eyeY+20);grad.addColorStop(0,'#11142b');grad.addColorStop(.5,spec.eyes||'#3b7578');grad.addColorStop(1,'#b0e8db');ctx.fillStyle=grad;ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(x,eyeY,15,Math.max(9,ry-3),0,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();ctx.fillStyle='#10111e';ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(x,eyeY-2,7,Math.max(8,ry-5),0,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();ctx.fillStyle='#fff';ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(x-5,eyeY-9,6,5,0,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(x+5,eyeY+7,2.5,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();}\n ctx.strokeStyle=hair;ctx.lineWidth=8;ctx.lineCap='round';ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(x-27,eyeY-40+(mood==='sad'?side*5:0));ctx.lineTo(x+27,eyeY-42+(mood==='narrow'?side*10:0));ctx.stroke();}\n ctx.strokeStyle='#92554e';ctx.lineWidth=3;ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(253,270);ctx.lineTo(246,292);ctx.lineTo(258,296);ctx.stroke();\n ctx.fillStyle='#6b3342';ctx.strokeStyle='#623444';ctx.lineWidth=3;ctx.beginPath();if(mouth){ctx.ellipse(256,334,14+mouth*3,6+mouth*5,0,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();ctx.fillStyle='#efb0a7';ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(256,340+mouth*2,11,3,0,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();}else{ctx.moveTo(235,329);ctx.quadraticCurveTo(255,mood==='sad'?320:340,277,328);ctx.stroke();}\n if(id==='ines'){ctx.strokeStyle='#9f6766';ctx.lineWidth=4;ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(172,166);ctx.lineTo(194,223);ctx.stroke();}\n if(['bell','voss'].includes(id)||overrides.age>55){ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(80,40,35,.35)';ctx.lineWidth=2;for(const side of [-1,1]){ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(256+side*95,237);ctx.lineTo(256+side*112,247);ctx.stroke();}}\n if(mood==='wide'&&id==='ren'){ctx.fillStyle='#a6e4ef';ctx.beginPath();ctx.ellipse(125,215,6,18,.3,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();}\n tex.needsUpdate=true;}\n const geo=new T.SphereGeometry(1,64,48),p=geo.attributes.position;for(let i=0;i<p.count;i++){let x=p.getX(i),y=p.getY(i),z=p.getZ(i);if(y<0){let t=-y,jaw=t>.25?((t-.25)/.75)**1.4:0;x*=1-.1*t-.42*jaw;z*=1-.12*t;z+=.05*t*t;y*=1+.16*t;}p.setXYZ(i,x,y,z*.94);}geo.computeVertexNormals();mesh(geo,toon('#ffffff',{map:tex}),head);\n mesh(new T.CylinderGeometry(.36,.44,.7,20),skin,body,0,-1.18,0);\n const points=[[.34,.9],[.55,.82],[1.5,.52],[1.95,.05],[2.08,-.8],[2.1,-2.2]].map(([r,y])=>new T.Vector2(r,y));const torso=mesh(new T.LatheGeometry(points,40),clothes,body,0,-2.08,0);torso.scale.z=.62;\n const collarMat=toon(id==='ines'?'#414350':'#d8efe4');for(const side of [-1,1]){const collar=box(body,collarMat,side*.37,-1.61,.58,.22,.72,.06);collar.rotation.z=side*.55;}\n if(id==='ren'||id==='bell'){for(const side of [-1,1]){const lapel=box(body,'#fbf4df',side*.63,-1.9,.73,.44,1.25,.08);lapel.rotation.z=side*.23;}tube(body,'#20333c',[[-.47,-1.25,.59],[-.65,-1.8,.9],[-.43,-2.3,.97],[.32,-2.33,.98],[.55,-1.6,.8],[.42,-1.25,.55]],.05);ball(body,'#97b3b0',.35,-2.3,1.03,.12,.12,.035);}\n if(id==='bell'){for(const side of [-1,1]){const bow=mesh(new T.ConeGeometry(.23,.4,3),'#91344a',body,side*.18,-1.5,.71);bow.rotation.z=side*Math.PI/2;const m=ball(head,'#f5ecd8',side*.29,-.44,.86,.38,.13,.12);m.rotation.z=-side*.15;}ball(head,'#f2e3cc',0,-.42,.92,.11,.11,.08);}\n if(spec.style\"'!=='\"'bald'){\n const cap=mesh(new T.SphereGeometry(1.06,40,24,0,Math.PI*2,0,Math.PI*.49),hair,head,0,.035,0);\n if(['bob','long','slick'].includes(spec.style)){const back=ball(head,hair,0,-.05,-.31,1.05,spec.style==='long'?1.5:1.08,.78);if(spec.style==='long')back.position.y=-.5;}\n if(spec.style\"'!=='\"'wrap')for(let i=0;i<19;i++){const a=i/18*Math.PI,x=Math.cos(a)*.91,y=.58+Math.sin(a)*.15,z=.52+Math.sin(a)*.24;const len=spec.style==='spiky'?.36+(i%3)*.12:spec.style==='bob'?.58:.32;const lock=mesh(new T.ConeGeometry(.19,len,5),hair,head,x,y,z);lock.rotation.z=Math.PI+(i-9)*.055;lock.rotation.x=.23;}\n if(spec.style==='bob'){box(head,'#e4e6df',.48,.48,.75,.12,.61,.08).rotation.z=-.14;for(const side of [-1,1])ball(head,hair,side*.9,-.3,.1,.21,.63,.35);}\n if(spec.style==='buns')for(const side of [-1,1]){ball(head,hair,side*.83,.83,-.13,.38,.37,.35);ring(head,'#eac157',side*.82,.74,.1,.27,.035);}\n }\n if(spec.style==='wrap'){for(let i=0;i<5;i++)ball(head,i%2?'#edaa29':'#f9c24a',0,.63+i*.08,-.02,1.08-i*.09,.35,.88-i*.04);ball(head,'#bfc3b9',0,.48,-.75,.57,.55,.4);const knot=ball(head,'#f2b134',-.65,.85,.25,.31,.45,.3);knot.rotation.z=.55;}\n if(['bea','sorrento'].includes(id)||spec.style==='wrap'){for(const side of [-1,1])ring(head,'#17252b',side*.36,.04,.91,.27,.033);tube(head,'#17252b',[[-.09,.04,.95],[0,.07,.98],[.09,.04,.95]],.023);}\n // Pens, pocket and hospital badge make the silhouette read as a clinician.\n box(body,'#e7e5ce',-.8,-2.2,.91,.36,.36,.055);box(body,'#e6ac3a',-.8,-2.14,.95,.25,.08,.025);for(let i=0;i<2;i++)box(body,i?'#e6b954':'#7ce3d2',.8+i*.09,-1.9,.93,.045,.38,.04);\n const mixer=new T.AnimationMixer(root),clips={};\n const add=(name,times,values,path,loop=false)=>{const clip=new T.AnimationClip(name,times.at(-1),[new T.NumberKeyframeTrack(path,times,values)]);const a=mixer.clipAction(clip);a.setLoop(loop?T.LoopRepeat:T.LoopOnce,loop?Infinity:1);a.clampWhenFinished=\"'!loop;clips[name]=a;};\n add('\"'idle',[0,1.6,3.2],[0,.018,0],'Body.rotation[z]',true);clips.idle.play();\n for(const [name,values] of Object.entries({nod:[0,.16,-.08,0],shake:[0,.17,-.17,0],shock:[0,-.25,-.1,0],lean:[0,.16,.16,0],sigh:[0,.1,.12,0],bow:[0,.3,.3,0],slump:[0,.3,.3,.3],collapse:[0,.3,1.1,1.7]}))add(name,[0,.16,.45,.8],values,\"'`Head.rotation[${name==='\"'shake'?'y':'x'}]\"'`);\n draw();return{root,spec,mixer,clips,expression(m){if(m!==mood){mood=m;draw();}},talk(n){n=Math.floor(n)%4;if(n!==mouth){mouth=n;draw();}},animate(name){clips[name]?.reset().play();},update(dt){mixer.update(dt);},dispose(){tex.dispose();}};\n}\nEOF\ncat > src/view/instruments.js <<'\"'EOF'\nimport * as T from 'three/webgpu';\nimport {mesh,ball,box,tube,ring,toon} from './materials.js';\nexport function createInstrument(tool){const root=new T.Group(),pivot=new T.Group();root.add(pivot);pivot.name='Tool';pivot.rotation.z=-.65;pivot.rotation.x=.4;\n const steel=toon('#b7d9d2'),dark=toon('#183c49'),grip=toon(tool===5?'#653747':tool===3?'#46bdab':'#358799');\n const rod=(x,z,l=.4,r=.018)=>mesh(new T.CylinderGeometry(r,r*.8,l,10),steel,pivot,x,l/2+.03,z);\n const jaws=[];\n if(tool===0){rod(0,0,.35,.025);const blade=mesh(new T.ConeGeometry(.038,.18,3),'#edf6e3',pivot,0,.015,0);blade.rotation.z=Math.PI;box(pivot,dark,0,.34,0,.055,.18,.04);}\n else if(tool===1||tool===7||tool===4){for(const side of [-1,1]){const jaw=new T.Group();jaw.name=side===1?'JawR':'JawL';jaw.position.x=side*.012;pivot.add(jaw);rod.call(null);tube(jaw,steel,[[side*.004,.0,0],[side*.035,.15,0],[side*.045,.38,0]],tool===7?.018:.012);ring(jaw,grip,side*.045,.4,0,.045,.009);jaws.push(jaw);}if(tool===4)tube(pivot,'#edf1e1',[[0,0,0],[.06,-.03,0],[.08,-.1,0],[.02,-.12,0]],.009);}\n else if(tool===6){rod(0,0,.32,.023);const disc=mesh(new T.CylinderGeometry(.08,.065,.035,32),dark,pivot,0,.02,0);ring(pivot,'#53eeee',0,0,.022,.062,.007).rotation.x=Math.PI/2;box(pivot,'#b8e9df',0,.28,0,.07,.16,.055);}\n else {rod(0,0,.35,.022);box(pivot,grip,0,.28,0,.065,.24,.06);if(tool===2)tube(pivot,'#1b414f',[[0,.4,0],[.08,.5,.03],[.17,.48,.14],[.26,.51,.26]],.018);if(tool===3)ball(pivot,'#a9ffe0',0,.15,0,.06,.12,.05);if(tool===5)ball(pivot,'#f36998',0,0,0,.025);}\n const mixer=new T.AnimationMixer(root);const clip=new T.AnimationClip('use',.3,[new T.NumberKeyframeTrack('Tool.position[y]',[0,.12,.3],[0,-.025,0])]);const action=mixer.clipAction(clip);action.play();action.paused=true;\n return{root,update(dt,use){action.paused=\"'!use;mixer.update(dt);for(let i=0;i<jaws.length;i++)jaws[i].rotation.z=(i?1:-1)*(use?.02:.09);}};\n}\nexport function makePaddles(){const root=new T.Group();for(const side of [-1,1]){const p=new T.Group();p.name=side===1?'\"'RightPaddle':'LeftPaddle';p.position.set(side*.65,.3,0);box(p,'#ced8ce',0,0,0,.36,.06,.3);box(p,'#d9b43e',0,.09,0,.22,.13,.12);tube(p,'#21333b',[[0,.1,0],[side*.2,.15,.2],[side*.4,.12,.3]],.025);root.add(p);}return root;}\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_26","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('src/view/instruments.js');s=p.read_text().replace('rod.call(null);','');p.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat > src/view/strains.js <<'EOF'\nimport * as T from 'three/webgpu';\nimport {mesh,ball,box,tube,ring,toon} from './materials.js';\nexport function skinBody(color='#2b1456',length=.5,radius=.11){const geo=new T.CylinderGeometry(radius*.7,radius,length,16,14),pos=geo.attributes.position,indices=[],weights=[];for(let i=0;i<pos.count;i++){const y=(pos.getY(i)+length/2)/length*2,k=Math.min(1,Math.floor(y)),f=y-k;indices.push(k,k+1,0,0);weights.push(1-f,f,0,0);}geo.setAttribute('skinIndex',new T.Uint16BufferAttribute(indices,4));geo.setAttribute('skinWeight',new T.Float32BufferAttribute(weights,4));\n const bones=[new T.Bone(),new T.Bone(),new T.Bone()];bones[0].position.y=-length/2;bones[1].position.y=length/2;bones[2].position.y=length/2;bones[0].add(bones[1]);bones[1].add(bones[2]);bones.forEach((b,i)=>b.name='Joint'+i);const m=new T.SkinnedMesh(geo,toon(color));m.add(bones[0]);m.bind(new T.Skeleton(bones));return{m,bones};}\nexport function strainModel(e){const root=new T.Group(),animations=[];const purple='#39205f',acid='#d7f24a';\n const worm=skinBody(e.kind==='tremolo'?'#c6cbf0':purple,e.kind==='coda'?.38:.46,e.kind==='coda'?.12:.1);worm.m.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;worm.m.position.y=.14;root.add(worm.m);\n const mixer=new T.AnimationMixer(root);for(const name of ['crawl','bite','shiver','flee','slither','jerk','swell','open','close','conduct','downbeat','cue','rest']){const clip=new T.AnimationClip(name,2,[new T.NumberKeyframeTrack('Joint1.rotation[z]',[0,.5,1,1.5,2],[0,.22,0,-.22,0])]);animations.push(mixer.clipAction(clip));}animations[0].play();\n const parts={};\n if(e.kind==='adagio'){for(let i=0;i<5;i++){const r=ring(root,acid,-.18+i*.085,.14,0,.11,.012);r.rotation.y=Math.PI/2;}const stem=tube(root,purple,[[.18,.12,0],[.22,.25,0],[.2,.42,0]],.026);ball(root,acid,.2,.4,0,.085,.035,.055);ball(root,'#faeec2',-.25,.18,.03,.035);parts.core=ball(root,'#f49a78',0,.24,.03,.07,.03,.06);}\n if(e.kind==='tremolo'){for(const side of [-1,1]){const w=ball(root,'#d6c7f5',side*.16,.1,0,.22,.025,.16);w.rotation.z=side*.2;for(let i=0;i<5;i++)tube(root,'#54526e',[[side*.06,.13,-.12+i*.06],[side*.27,.15,-.09+i*.05]],.006);parts['wing'+side]=w;}ball(root,'#f4eac6',0,.14,0,.05,.08,.05);}\n if(e.kind==='fermata'){worm.m.visible=false;const arc=mesh(new T.TorusGeometry(.26,.055,12,40,Math.PI),purple,root,0,.09,0);arc.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;ball(root,'#dcc6ef',0,.06,0,.12,.055,.08);parts.core=ball(root,acid,0,.11,0,.06,.04,.05);}\n if(e.kind==='coda'){worm.m.visible=false;ring(root,purple,0,.14,0,.2,.06).rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;box(root,acid,0,.17,0,.025,.04,.54);box(root,acid,0,.17,0,.52,.04,.025);parts.core=ball(root,'#e7be4c',0,.13,0,.11,.06,.11);parts.arms=[];for(const side of [-1,1]){const arm=new T.Group();tube(arm,purple,[[side*.17,.12,0],[side*.33,.25,-.08],[side*.5,.12,-.15]],.03);for(let i=0;i<5;i++)ring(arm,acid,side*(.22+i*.055),.13,-.03-i*.025,.04,.008).rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;ball(arm,'#eb8064',side*.5,.14,-.15,.06,.12,.06);root.add(arm);parts.arms.push(arm);}const coat=mesh(new T.ConeGeometry(.31,.35,4,1,true),purple,root,0,.09,.22);coat.rotation.x=Math.PI/2;}\n if(e.kind==='crescendo'){worm.m.visible=false;parts.ring=ring(root,purple,0,.08,0,.3,.045);parts.ring.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;for(let i=0;i<8;i++){const a=i/8*Math.PI*2;const p=ball(parts.ring,acid,Math.cos(a)*.3,Math.sin(a)*.3,0,.035);}}\n return{root,update(dt,s){mixer.update(dt*s.bpm/80);if(parts.core)parts.core.material.color.set(s.beat%4>=2?'#fff2c8':acid);if(e.kind==='tremolo'){for(const side of [-1,1])parts['wing'+side].rotation.z=side*Math.sin(s.elapsed*38)*.12;}if(e.kind==='coda')parts.arms.forEach((a,i)=>{a.visible=e.arms>i;a.rotation.y=Math.sin(s.beatPhase*Math.PI*2)*.12;});if(parts.ring)parts.ring.scale.setScalar((e.size||.2)*1.4+.5);}};\n}\nEOF\ncat > src/view/entities.js <<'EOF'\nimport * as T from 'three/webgpu';\nimport {mesh,ball,box,tube,ring,toon,flatLabel} from './materials.js';\nimport {strainModel} from './strains.js';\nconst col={gold:'#f2b134',cyan:'#39e6e6',blood:'#c4142f',purple:'#35205d',mint:'#7cf2c9'};\nconst strains=['adagio','tremolo','crescendo','fermata','coda'];\nexport function entityModel(e){if(strains.includes(e.kind))return strainModel(e);const root=new T.Group(),parts={};const glow=toon(col.gold,{emissive:col.gold,emissiveIntensity:.25});\n if(e.kind==='shard'){const shape=new T.Shape();shape.moveTo(-.055,-.11);shape.lineTo(.06,-.035);shape.lineTo(.04,.13);shape.lineTo(-.02,.075);shape.closePath();const g=new T.ExtrudeGeometry(shape,{depth:.025,bevelEnabled:true,bevelSize:.005,bevelThickness:.006,bevelSegments:1});const m=mesh(g,toon('#b5eff2'),root,0,.045,0);m.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;m.rotation.z=-.45;ring(root,col.gold,0,.025,0,.11,.008).rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;}\n if(e.kind==='tumor'||e.kind==='nodule'||e.kind==='egg'||e.kind==='feeder'||e.kind==='piece'){const c=e.kind==='piece'?'#d2d680':e.kind==='feeder'?'#ab71b3':e.kind==='egg'?'#ede0b2':col.purple;const n=ball(root,c,0,.07,0,e.kind==='tumor'?.19:.075,e.kind==='tumor'?.13:.065,e.kind==='tumor'?.15:.075);ball(root,'#f3e6da',-.02,.12,.02,.019,.008,.025);if(e.kind==='feeder')tube(root,col.purple,[[0,.02,0],[-e.x*.2,.04,e.y*.2],[-e.x*.55,.01,e.y*.55]],.015);}\n if(['pool','spore','scratch'].includes(e.kind)){if(e.kind==='scratch'){tube(root,'#9b2247',[[-.12,.01,-.03],[-.04,.02,.015],[.05,.02,-.01],[.13,.01,.03]],.019);}else{parts.blob=ball(root,e.kind==='pool'?col.blood:'#a6b94d',0,.025,0,.15,.018,.11);ball(root,'#f7949a',-.04,.047,-.03,.045,.003,.012);}}\n if(e.kind==='gelZone'){parts.cells=[];for(let i=0;i<e.cells.length;i+=10){const c=e.cells[i],b=ball(root,col.mint,c[0]-e.x,.01,-(c[1]-e.y),.025,.004,.025);b.visible=false;parts.cells.push([i,b]);}const w=e.w/2,h=e.h/2;for(const side of [-1,1])for(let x=-w;x<=w;x+=.075)ball(root,col.gold,x,.015,side*h,.009);for(const side of [-1,1])for(let y=-h;y<=h;y+=.075)ball(root,col.gold,side*w,.015,y,.009);}\n if(e.kind==='incision'||e.kind==='tether'){parts.points=[];for(let i=0;i<e.points.length;i++){const p=e.points[i];if(i)tube(root,e.kind==='incision'?col.gold:col.cyan,[[e.points[i-1][0]-e.x,.018,-e.points[i-1][1]+e.y],[p[0]-e.x,.018,-p[1]+e.y]],e.kind==='tether'?.017:.009);}parts.start=ring(root,col.gold,0,.025,0,.055,.012);parts.start.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;}\n if(e.kind==='wound'){tube(root,'#8b2045',[[e.gates[0][0]-e.x,.008,0],[e.gates.at(-1)[0]-e.x,.008,0]],.032);parts.gates=[];parts.threads=[];for(let i=0;i<e.gates.length;i++){const p=e.gates[i];const r=ring(root,i?col.cyan:col.gold,p[0]-e.x,.027,-p[1]+e.y,.037,.007);r.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;const n=flatLabel(root,String(i+1),p[0]-e.x,.04,-p[1]+e.y,.075,.075,i?col.cyan:col.gold);n.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;parts.gates.push(r);if(i){const q=e.gates[i-1],thread=tube(root,'#2b6cff',[[q[0]-e.x,.03,-q[1]+e.y],[p[0]-e.x,.035,-p[1]+e.y]],.006);thread.visible=false;parts.threads.push(thread);}}}\n if(e.kind==='bleeder'){ball(root,'#811e3a',0,.025,0,.055,.015,.055);parts.ring=ring(root,col.gold,0,.04,0,.14,.012);parts.ring.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;parts.clamp=new T.Group();for(const side of [-1,1]){const bar=box(parts.clamp,'#badad2',side*.02,.08,0,.024,.05,.21);bar.rotation.y=side*.2;}ring(parts.clamp,'#72a4a7',0,.1,.13,.045,.012).rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;root.add(parts.clamp);parts.clamp.visible=\"'!!e.clamped;parts.spurt=ball(root,col.blood,0,.12,0,.014,.09,.014);}\n if(e.kind==='\"'note'){ball(root,'#321b4b',-.025,.04,0,.065,.025,.045);tube(root,'#301741',[[.02,.04,0],[.02,.27,0]],.012);tube(root,col.gold,[[.02,.27,0],[.1,.22,0],[.09,.16,0]],.014);}\n if(e.kind==='nest'||e.kind==='scanMark'){parts.ring=ring(root,e.kind==='nest'?'#4f2d68':col.gold,0,.025,0,.075,.022);parts.ring.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;ball(root,'#172b39',0,.02,0,.066,.004,.066);}\n if(e.kind==='injection'){parts.ring=ring(root,'#82eddf',0,.035,0,.1,.014);parts.ring.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;box(root,col.mint,0,.027,0,.028,.01,.12);box(root,col.mint,0,.027,0,.12,.01,.028);}\n if(e.kind==='legato'){parts.nodes=[];parts.links=[];for(let i=0;i<e.nodes.length;i++){const n=e.nodes[i];parts.nodes.push(ball(root,col.purple,n.x-e.x,.09,-n.y+e.y,.055,.045,.055));if(i){const p=e.nodes[i-1];parts.links.push(tube(root,'#b2ac71',[[p.x-e.x,.05,-p.y+e.y],[(p.x+n.x)/2-e.x,.1,-(p.y+n.y)/2+e.y],[n.x-e.x,.05,-n.y+e.y]],.017));}}parts.active=ring(root,col.gold,.6,.08,0,.09,.012);parts.active.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;}\n if(extractable(e)){const a=(e.axis||90)*Math.PI/180;const arrow=new T.Group();tube(arrow,col.gold,[[0,.03,0],[Math.cos(a)*.21,.03,-Math.sin(a)*.21]],.007);const cone=mesh(new T.ConeGeometry(.027,.065,3),col.gold,arrow,Math.cos(a)*.23,.03,-Math.sin(a)*.23);cone.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;cone.rotation.z=a-Math.PI/2;root.add(arrow);parts.arrow=arrow;}\n return{root,update(dt,s){if(parts.ring){parts.ring.scale.setScalar(e.kind==='bleeder'?.55+(1-s.beatPhase)*.6:1+Math.sin(s.elapsed*3)*.04);}if(parts.clamp){parts.clamp.visible=\"'!!e.clamped;parts.spurt.visible=!e.clamped&&!e.removed;parts.spurt.scale.y=.4+s.pulse;}\n if(parts.blob)parts.blob.scale.setScalar(e.kind==='\"'pool'?Math.sqrt(Math.max(.05,e.vol))+.25:1);\n if(parts.cells)for(const [i,m] of parts.cells)m.visible=\"'!!e.cells[i]?.[2];\n if(parts.gates)parts.gates.forEach((r,i)=>{r.material.color.set(i<e.gate?'\"'#2b6cff':i===e.gate?col.gold:col.cyan);r.scale.setScalar(i===e.gate?1+s.pulse*.16:1);});if(parts.threads)parts.threads.forEach((m,i)=>m.visible=i<e.gate-1);\n if(parts.start)parts.start.visible=\"'!e.started;\n if(parts.nodes){parts.nodes.forEach((m,i)=>m.visible=!e.nodes[i].cut&&!e.nodes[i].deposited);parts.links.forEach((m,i)=>m.visible=!e.nodes[i+1].cut&&!e.nodes[i+1].deposited);const n=e.nodes[e.remaining];parts.active.visible=!!n&&!n.cut;if(n)parts.active.position.set(n.x-e.x,.09,-n.y+e.y);}\n if(parts.arrow)parts.arrow.visible=!e.embedded&&!e.done;\n }};\n}\nfunction extractable(e){return ['\"'shard','tumor','piece'].includes(e.kind);}\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_26","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('src/view/instruments.js');s=p.read_text().replace('rod.call(null);','');p.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat > src/view/strains.js <<'EOF'\nimport * as T from 'three/webgpu';\nimport {mesh,ball,box,tube,ring,toon} from './materials.js';\nexport function skinBody(color='#2b1456',length=.5,radius=.11){const geo=new T.CylinderGeometry(radius*.7,radius,length,16,14),pos=geo.attributes.position,indices=[],weights=[];for(let i=0;i<pos.count;i++){const y=(pos.getY(i)+length/2)/length*2,k=Math.min(1,Math.floor(y)),f=y-k;indices.push(k,k+1,0,0);weights.push(1-f,f,0,0);}geo.setAttribute('skinIndex',new T.Uint16BufferAttribute(indices,4));geo.setAttribute('skinWeight',new T.Float32BufferAttribute(weights,4));\n const bones=[new T.Bone(),new T.Bone(),new T.Bone()];bones[0].position.y=-length/2;bones[1].position.y=length/2;bones[2].position.y=length/2;bones[0].add(bones[1]);bones[1].add(bones[2]);bones.forEach((b,i)=>b.name='Joint'+i);const m=new T.SkinnedMesh(geo,toon(color));m.add(bones[0]);m.bind(new T.Skeleton(bones));return{m,bones};}\nexport function strainModel(e){const root=new T.Group(),animations=[];const purple='#39205f',acid='#d7f24a';\n const worm=skinBody(e.kind==='tremolo'?'#c6cbf0':purple,e.kind==='coda'?.38:.46,e.kind==='coda'?.12:.1);worm.m.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;worm.m.position.y=.14;root.add(worm.m);\n const mixer=new T.AnimationMixer(root);for(const name of ['crawl','bite','shiver','flee','slither','jerk','swell','open','close','conduct','downbeat','cue','rest']){const clip=new T.AnimationClip(name,2,[new T.NumberKeyframeTrack('Joint1.rotation[z]',[0,.5,1,1.5,2],[0,.22,0,-.22,0])]);animations.push(mixer.clipAction(clip));}animations[0].play();\n const parts={};\n if(e.kind==='adagio'){for(let i=0;i<5;i++){const r=ring(root,acid,-.18+i*.085,.14,0,.11,.012);r.rotation.y=Math.PI/2;}const stem=tube(root,purple,[[.18,.12,0],[.22,.25,0],[.2,.42,0]],.026);ball(root,acid,.2,.4,0,.085,.035,.055);ball(root,'#faeec2',-.25,.18,.03,.035);parts.core=ball(root,'#f49a78',0,.24,.03,.07,.03,.06);}\n if(e.kind==='tremolo'){for(const side of [-1,1]){const w=ball(root,'#d6c7f5',side*.16,.1,0,.22,.025,.16);w.rotation.z=side*.2;for(let i=0;i<5;i++)tube(root,'#54526e',[[side*.06,.13,-.12+i*.06],[side*.27,.15,-.09+i*.05]],.006);parts['wing'+side]=w;}ball(root,'#f4eac6',0,.14,0,.05,.08,.05);}\n if(e.kind==='fermata'){worm.m.visible=false;const arc=mesh(new T.TorusGeometry(.26,.055,12,40,Math.PI),purple,root,0,.09,0);arc.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;ball(root,'#dcc6ef',0,.06,0,.12,.055,.08);parts.core=ball(root,acid,0,.11,0,.06,.04,.05);}\n if(e.kind==='coda'){worm.m.visible=false;ring(root,purple,0,.14,0,.2,.06).rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;box(root,acid,0,.17,0,.025,.04,.54);box(root,acid,0,.17,0,.52,.04,.025);parts.core=ball(root,'#e7be4c',0,.13,0,.11,.06,.11);parts.arms=[];for(const side of [-1,1]){const arm=new T.Group();tube(arm,purple,[[side*.17,.12,0],[side*.33,.25,-.08],[side*.5,.12,-.15]],.03);for(let i=0;i<5;i++)ring(arm,acid,side*(.22+i*.055),.13,-.03-i*.025,.04,.008).rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;ball(arm,'#eb8064',side*.5,.14,-.15,.06,.12,.06);root.add(arm);parts.arms.push(arm);}const coat=mesh(new T.ConeGeometry(.31,.35,4,1,true),purple,root,0,.09,.22);coat.rotation.x=Math.PI/2;}\n if(e.kind==='crescendo'){worm.m.visible=false;parts.ring=ring(root,purple,0,.08,0,.3,.045);parts.ring.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;for(let i=0;i<8;i++){const a=i/8*Math.PI*2;const p=ball(parts.ring,acid,Math.cos(a)*.3,Math.sin(a)*.3,0,.035);}}\n return{root,update(dt,s){mixer.update(dt*s.bpm/80);if(parts.core)parts.core.material.color.set(s.beat%4>=2?'#fff2c8':acid);if(e.kind==='tremolo'){for(const side of [-1,1])parts['wing'+side].rotation.z=side*Math.sin(s.elapsed*38)*.12;}if(e.kind==='coda')parts.arms.forEach((a,i)=>{a.visible=e.arms>i;a.rotation.y=Math.sin(s.beatPhase*Math.PI*2)*.12;});if(parts.ring)parts.ring.scale.setScalar((e.size||.2)*1.4+.5);}};\n}\nEOF\ncat > src/view/entities.js <<'EOF'\nimport * as T from 'three/webgpu';\nimport {mesh,ball,box,tube,ring,toon,flatLabel} from './materials.js';\nimport {strainModel} from './strains.js';\nconst col={gold:'#f2b134',cyan:'#39e6e6',blood:'#c4142f',purple:'#35205d',mint:'#7cf2c9'};\nconst strains=['adagio','tremolo','crescendo','fermata','coda'];\nexport function entityModel(e){if(strains.includes(e.kind))return strainModel(e);const root=new T.Group(),parts={};const glow=toon(col.gold,{emissive:col.gold,emissiveIntensity:.25});\n if(e.kind==='shard'){const shape=new T.Shape();shape.moveTo(-.055,-.11);shape.lineTo(.06,-.035);shape.lineTo(.04,.13);shape.lineTo(-.02,.075);shape.closePath();const g=new T.ExtrudeGeometry(shape,{depth:.025,bevelEnabled:true,bevelSize:.005,bevelThickness:.006,bevelSegments:1});const m=mesh(g,toon('#b5eff2'),root,0,.045,0);m.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;m.rotation.z=-.45;ring(root,col.gold,0,.025,0,.11,.008).rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;}\n if(e.kind==='tumor'||e.kind==='nodule'||e.kind==='egg'||e.kind==='feeder'||e.kind==='piece'){const c=e.kind==='piece'?'#d2d680':e.kind==='feeder'?'#ab71b3':e.kind==='egg'?'#ede0b2':col.purple;const n=ball(root,c,0,.07,0,e.kind==='tumor'?.19:.075,e.kind==='tumor'?.13:.065,e.kind==='tumor'?.15:.075);ball(root,'#f3e6da',-.02,.12,.02,.019,.008,.025);if(e.kind==='feeder')tube(root,col.purple,[[0,.02,0],[-e.x*.2,.04,e.y*.2],[-e.x*.55,.01,e.y*.55]],.015);}\n if(['pool','spore','scratch'].includes(e.kind)){if(e.kind==='scratch'){tube(root,'#9b2247',[[-.12,.01,-.03],[-.04,.02,.015],[.05,.02,-.01],[.13,.01,.03]],.019);}else{parts.blob=ball(root,e.kind==='pool'?col.blood:'#a6b94d',0,.025,0,.15,.018,.11);ball(root,'#f7949a',-.04,.047,-.03,.045,.003,.012);}}\n if(e.kind==='gelZone'){parts.cells=[];for(let i=0;i<e.cells.length;i+=10){const c=e.cells[i],b=ball(root,col.mint,c[0]-e.x,.01,-(c[1]-e.y),.025,.004,.025);b.visible=false;parts.cells.push([i,b]);}const w=e.w/2,h=e.h/2;for(const side of [-1,1])for(let x=-w;x<=w;x+=.075)ball(root,col.gold,x,.015,side*h,.009);for(const side of [-1,1])for(let y=-h;y<=h;y+=.075)ball(root,col.gold,side*w,.015,y,.009);}\n if(e.kind==='incision'||e.kind==='tether'){parts.points=[];for(let i=0;i<e.points.length;i++){const p=e.points[i];if(i)tube(root,e.kind==='incision'?col.gold:col.cyan,[[e.points[i-1][0]-e.x,.018,-e.points[i-1][1]+e.y],[p[0]-e.x,.018,-p[1]+e.y]],e.kind==='tether'?.017:.009);}parts.start=ring(root,col.gold,0,.025,0,.055,.012);parts.start.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;}\n if(e.kind==='wound'){tube(root,'#8b2045',[[e.gates[0][0]-e.x,.008,0],[e.gates.at(-1)[0]-e.x,.008,0]],.032);parts.gates=[];parts.threads=[];for(let i=0;i<e.gates.length;i++){const p=e.gates[i];const r=ring(root,i?col.cyan:col.gold,p[0]-e.x,.027,-p[1]+e.y,.037,.007);r.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;const n=flatLabel(root,String(i+1),p[0]-e.x,.04,-p[1]+e.y,.075,.075,i?col.cyan:col.gold);n.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;parts.gates.push(r);if(i){const q=e.gates[i-1],thread=tube(root,'#2b6cff',[[q[0]-e.x,.03,-q[1]+e.y],[p[0]-e.x,.035,-p[1]+e.y]],.006);thread.visible=false;parts.threads.push(thread);}}}\n if(e.kind==='bleeder'){ball(root,'#811e3a',0,.025,0,.055,.015,.055);parts.ring=ring(root,col.gold,0,.04,0,.14,.012);parts.ring.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;parts.clamp=new T.Group();for(const side of [-1,1]){const bar=box(parts.clamp,'#badad2',side*.02,.08,0,.024,.05,.21);bar.rotation.y=side*.2;}ring(parts.clamp,'#72a4a7',0,.1,.13,.045,.012).rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;root.add(parts.clamp);parts.clamp.visible=\"'!!e.clamped;parts.spurt=ball(root,col.blood,0,.12,0,.014,.09,.014);}\n if(e.kind==='\"'note'){ball(root,'#321b4b',-.025,.04,0,.065,.025,.045);tube(root,'#301741',[[.02,.04,0],[.02,.27,0]],.012);tube(root,col.gold,[[.02,.27,0],[.1,.22,0],[.09,.16,0]],.014);}\n if(e.kind==='nest'||e.kind==='scanMark'){parts.ring=ring(root,e.kind==='nest'?'#4f2d68':col.gold,0,.025,0,.075,.022);parts.ring.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;ball(root,'#172b39',0,.02,0,.066,.004,.066);}\n if(e.kind==='injection'){parts.ring=ring(root,'#82eddf',0,.035,0,.1,.014);parts.ring.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;box(root,col.mint,0,.027,0,.028,.01,.12);box(root,col.mint,0,.027,0,.12,.01,.028);}\n if(e.kind==='legato'){parts.nodes=[];parts.links=[];for(let i=0;i<e.nodes.length;i++){const n=e.nodes[i];parts.nodes.push(ball(root,col.purple,n.x-e.x,.09,-n.y+e.y,.055,.045,.055));if(i){const p=e.nodes[i-1];parts.links.push(tube(root,'#b2ac71',[[p.x-e.x,.05,-p.y+e.y],[(p.x+n.x)/2-e.x,.1,-(p.y+n.y)/2+e.y],[n.x-e.x,.05,-n.y+e.y]],.017));}}parts.active=ring(root,col.gold,.6,.08,0,.09,.012);parts.active.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;}\n if(extractable(e)){const a=(e.axis||90)*Math.PI/180;const arrow=new T.Group();tube(arrow,col.gold,[[0,.03,0],[Math.cos(a)*.21,.03,-Math.sin(a)*.21]],.007);const cone=mesh(new T.ConeGeometry(.027,.065,3),col.gold,arrow,Math.cos(a)*.23,.03,-Math.sin(a)*.23);cone.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;cone.rotation.z=a-Math.PI/2;root.add(arrow);parts.arrow=arrow;}\n return{root,update(dt,s){if(parts.ring){parts.ring.scale.setScalar(e.kind==='bleeder'?.55+(1-s.beatPhase)*.6:1+Math.sin(s.elapsed*3)*.04);}if(parts.clamp){parts.clamp.visible=\"'!!e.clamped;parts.spurt.visible=!e.clamped&&!e.removed;parts.spurt.scale.y=.4+s.pulse;}\n if(parts.blob)parts.blob.scale.setScalar(e.kind==='\"'pool'?Math.sqrt(Math.max(.05,e.vol))+.25:1);\n if(parts.cells)for(const [i,m] of parts.cells)m.visible=\"'!!e.cells[i]?.[2];\n if(parts.gates)parts.gates.forEach((r,i)=>{r.material.color.set(i<e.gate?'\"'#2b6cff':i===e.gate?col.gold:col.cyan);r.scale.setScalar(i===e.gate?1+s.pulse*.16:1);});if(parts.threads)parts.threads.forEach((m,i)=>m.visible=i<e.gate-1);\n if(parts.start)parts.start.visible=\"'!e.started;\n if(parts.nodes){parts.nodes.forEach((m,i)=>m.visible=!e.nodes[i].cut&&!e.nodes[i].deposited);parts.links.forEach((m,i)=>m.visible=!e.nodes[i+1].cut&&!e.nodes[i+1].deposited);const n=e.nodes[e.remaining];parts.active.visible=!!n&&!n.cut;if(n)parts.active.position.set(n.x-e.x,.09,-n.y+e.y);}\n if(parts.arrow)parts.arrow.visible=!e.embedded&&!e.done;\n }};\n}\nfunction extractable(e){return ['\"'shard','tumor','piece'].includes(e.kind);}\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_27","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > src/view/renderer.js <<'EOF'\nimport * as T from 'three/webgpu';\nimport RAPIER from '@dimforge/rapier3d-compat';\nimport {createInk} from './ink.js';\nimport {makeField} from './field.js';\nimport {mesh,box,ball,tube,ring,flatLabel,toon} from './materials.js';\nimport {createBust} from './bust.js';\nimport {createInstrument,makePaddles} from './instruments.js';\nimport {entityModel} from './entities.js';\nimport {operations} from '../data/ops/index.js';\nimport {cast} from '../data/cast.js';\nfunction makeRoom(scene){const room=new T.Group();scene.add(room);box(room,'#102d34',0,-.8,0,12,.15,12);box(room,'#1d4c52',0,2,-3.2,12,6,.2);\n for(let x=-5.5;x<=5.5;x+=.55)for(let y=-.5;y<4.6;y+=.55){box(room,(Math.round((x+5.5)/.55)+Math.round(y/.55))%4===0?'#245359':'#21494e',x,y,-3.07,.53,.53,.025);}\n for(const x of [-4.4,4.4]){box(room,'#15333e',x,1.1,-2.95,2.1,2.6,.1);box(room,'#102332',x,1.1,-2.85,1.95,2.4,.03);for(let i=0;i<9;i++)box(room,'#215461',x-.87+i*.22,1.05,-2.81,.012,2.3,.02);box(room,'#486f70',x,1.1,-2.79,2,.035,.02);}\n flatLabel(room,'ST. ALDER MEMORIAL',0,3.35,-2.93,4,.55,'#acc2ba');flatLabel(room,'OPERATING THEATRE  /  03',0,2.85,-2.91,3.5,.4,'#f2b134');\n const table=new T.Group();room.add(table);box(table,'#102f36',0,-.38,0,3.5,.3,2.15);box(table,'#5f8d8d',0,-.61,0,.7,.4,1.1);for(const x of [-1.45,1.45])box(table,'#9cbdba',x,-.25,0,.05,.07,2.2);\n const lamp=new T.Group();lamp.name='Lamp';lamp.position.set(.3,2.5,-.6);room.add(lamp);tube(lamp,'#9ebdb7',[[0,.08,0],[0,.7,0],[1.6,.7,0],[1.6,1.6,0]],.055);const shade=mesh(new T.CylinderGeometry(.55,.65,.15,12),'#90b8ae',lamp);shade.rotation.x=.15;const lightmat=new T.MeshBasicNodeMaterial({color:'#f8ecc5'});const disc=mesh(new T.CylinderGeometry(.56,.56,.025,32),lightmat,lamp,0,-.09,0);for(let i=0;i<6;i++){const a=i/6*Math.PI*2;ball(lamp,'#fff4d5',Math.cos(a)*.34,-.12,Math.sin(a)*.34,.13,.018,.13);}ring(lamp,'#153b43',0,-.12,0,.62,.025).rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;\n const mixer=new T.AnimationMixer(room);const action=mixer.clipAction(new T.AnimationClip('lamp swing',8,[new T.NumberKeyframeTrack('Lamp.rotation[z]',[0,2,4,6,8],[.025,0,-.025,0,.025])]));action.play();\n for(const x of [-2.5,2.8]){const monitor=new T.Group();monitor.position.set(x,.45,-1.6);room.add(monitor);box(monitor,'#0d202a',0,0,0,.88,.63,.19);box(monitor,'#b9c4ae',0,-.37,.01,.9,.07,.24);box(monitor,'#071923',0,0,.11,.73,.48,.025);tube(monitor,'#6de1c3',[[-.33,-.02,.14],[-.17,-.02,.14],[-.1,.02,.14],[-.05,-.17,.14],[.01,.19,.14],[.06,-.03,.14],[.33,-.02,.14]],.008);for(let i=0;i<3;i++)ball(monitor,i?'#567c73':'#f2b134',.33,-.2+i*.07,.13,.015);tube(monitor,'#829e95',[[0,-.4,0],[0,-1.12,0],[.3,-1.15,0]],.03);}\n return {root:room,lamp,mixer};}\nexport async function createView(container,{forceWebGL=false,noRender=false,onError=()=>{}}={}){\n const renderer=new T.WebGPURenderer({antialias:false,forceWebGL});renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,1.6));renderer.toneMapping=T.NoToneMapping;renderer.shadowMap.enabled=true;renderer.shadowMap.type=T.PCFSoftShadowMap;renderer.onDeviceLost=onError;await renderer.init();\n renderer.domElement.id='world';renderer.domElement.setAttribute('aria-label','Three-dimensional operating theatre');container.prepend(renderer.domElement);\n const scene=new T.Scene();scene.background=new T.Color('#0b2529');scene.fog=new T.Fog('#0b2529',9,24);\n const camera=new T.PerspectiveCamera(34,innerWidth/innerHeight,.1,60);scene.add(camera);\n const ambient=new T.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x819ba0,1.5);scene.add(ambient);const light=new T.DirectionalLight(0xfff2de,1.9);light.position.set(2.5,5,2);light.castShadow=true;light.shadow.mapSize.set(2048,2048);light.shadow.bias=-.0006;light.shadow.normalBias=.03;light.shadow.camera.left=-4;light.shadow.camera.right=4;light.shadow.camera.top=4;light.shadow.camera.bottom=-4;scene.add(light);\n const room=makeRoom(scene),field=makeField();scene.add(field.root);\n const entities=new T.Group(),tips=new T.Group(),storyRoot=new T.Group(),effects=new T.Group();scene.add(entities,tips,storyRoot,effects);\n const entityMap=new Map(),tipMap=new Map(),mixers=[];let currentSite='',mode='title',busts=[],speaker='bea',state=null,elapsed=0,flash=0,speed=0,hush=0,shake=0,lastPaint=0;\n const ink=createInk(renderer,scene,camera);\n const portraitScene=new T.Scene();portraitScene.background=new T.Color('#163f49');portraitScene.add(new T.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x6f8f96,2));const pl=new T.DirectionalLight(0xffe5c7,2);pl.position.set(2,3,4);portraitScene.add(pl);const portraitCam=new T.PerspectiveCamera(30,1,.1,20);portraitCam.position.set(0,-.2,5);portraitCam.lookAt(0,-.1,0);const portraitTarget=new T.RenderTarget(256,256);let portraitBust=createBust('bea');portraitScene.add(portraitBust.root);\n const pg=new T.PlaneGeometry(.29,.29);const uvs=pg.attributes.uv;for(let i=0;i<uvs.count;i++)uvs.setY(i,1-uvs.getY(i));const portrait=mesh(pg,new T.MeshBasicNodeMaterial({map:portraitTarget.texture,depthTest:false,depthWrite:false}),camera,0,-.43,-2);portrait.renderOrder=10;portrait.visible=false;\n const paddles=makePaddles();scene.add(paddles);paddles.visible=false;\n const stamps=new T.Group();scene.add(stamps);const clipboard=box(stamps,'#bf9c6c',0,.1,0,1.25,.06,1.65);const paper=box(stamps,'#f4f1e8',0,.14,0,1.12,.012,1.45);box(stamps,'#8baea9',0,.17,-.65,.45,.08,.12);const stamp=box(stamps,'#8d3a49',0,.9,0,.34,.18,.22);stamp.name='RankStamp';const stampMixer=new T.AnimationMixer(stamps);const stampAction=stampMixer.clipAction(new T.AnimationClip('stamp',.65,[new T.NumberKeyframeTrack('RankStamp.position[y]',[0,.24,.32,.43,.65],[1.2,1.2,.24,.3,.24])]));stampAction.setLoop(T.LoopOnce);stampAction.clampWhenFinished=true;stamps.visible=false;\n // A small view-only physics world supplies drops, sparks and thread follow-through.\n const cosmeticWorld=new RAPIER.World({x:0,y:-3.4,z:0});cosmeticWorld.timestep=1/60;const floor=cosmeticWorld.createRigidBody(RAPIER.RigidBodyDesc.fixed().setTranslation(0,-.06,0));cosmeticWorld.createCollider(RAPIER.ColliderDesc.cuboid(5,.03,5),floor);\n const particleMesh=new T.InstancedMesh(new T.SphereGeometry(.012,6,4),toon('#ffffff'),140);effects.add(particleMesh);const particles=[];const dummy=new T.Object3D();particleMesh.count=0;\n function burst(x,y,color,count=8){for(let i=0;i<count&&particles.length<140;i++){const b=cosmeticWorld.createRigidBody(RAPIER.RigidBodyDesc.dynamic().setTranslation(x,.35,-y).setLinvel(Math.cos(i*2.4)*.35,.2+i%3*.14,Math.sin(i*2.4)*.3));particles.push({b,life:.6+i*.02,color:new T.Color(color)});}}\n function resize(){const w=innerWidth,h=innerHeight;renderer.setSize(w,h);camera.aspect=w/h;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();const portraitX=w/h>1.4?-.32:-.18;portrait.position.set(portraitX,-.43,-2);}\n addEventListener('resize',resize);resize();\n const ray=new T.Raycaster(),mouse=new T.Vector2();\n function project(x,y,z){const v=new T.Vector3(x,z??field.height(x,y)+.05,-y).project(camera);return{x:(v.x+1)/2*innerWidth,y:(1-v.y)/2*innerHeight,visible:v.z<1};}\n function screenToField(x,y){mouse.set(x/innerWidth*2-1,1-y/innerHeight*2);ray.setFromCamera(mouse,camera);const p=new T.Vector3();let height=.2;for(let i=0;i<4;i++){ray.ray.intersectPlane(new T.Plane(new T.Vector3(0,1,0),-height),p);height=p.x>1.36?.45:field.height(p.x,-p.z);}return{x:p.x,y:-p.z};}\n function setSpeaker(id){if(id===speaker)return;speaker=id;portraitScene.remove(portraitBust.root);portraitBust.dispose();portraitBust=createBust(id);portraitScene.add(portraitBust.root);}\n function stage(data,line){mode='story';for(const b of busts)storyRoot.remove(b.root);busts=[];const ids=[...new Set(data.lines.map(l=>l.who))].slice(0,2);if(\"'!ids.includes(line.who))ids[1]=line.who;ids.forEach((id,i)=>{const b=createBust(id);b.root.position.set((i?1:-1)*1.62,.65,.1);b.root.scale.setScalar(.67);b.root.rotation.y=(i?-.15:.15);storyRoot.add(b.root);busts.push(b);});if(data.set==='\"'ward')scene.background.set('#15352f');else if(data.set==='lab')scene.background.set('#12303f');else scene.background.set('#0b2529');speak(line);}\n function speak(line){for(const b of busts){const active=b.spec.name===cast[line.who]?.name;b.expression(active?line.expression||'neutral':'neutral');if(active)b.animate(line.shout?'shock':'nod');}if(line.shout){speed=1;shake=.07;}}\n function event(e){if(e.type==='grade'){burst(e.x,e.y,e.grade==='MISS'?'#e8443a':'#f2b134',5);if(e.grade==='FLAWLESS')shake=.012;}if(e.type==='pop'||e.type==='deposit'){burst(e.x||1.6,e.y||.2,'#b8e5dc',8);}if(e.type==='hush'){hush=1;speed=1;}if(e.type==='sforzando'){flash=.45;speed=1;shake=.07;}if(e.type==='defib'){flash=1;shake=.09;speed=1;}if(e.type==='fortissimo'){speed=1;shake=.08;}if(['nick','scorch'].includes(e.type)&&elapsed-lastPaint>.06){field.paint(e.type,e.x,e.y);lastPaint=elapsed;}}\n function setMode(m){if(mode===m)return;mode=m;if(m==='report'){stampAction.reset().play();flash=.2;}}\n function update(s,dt,settings={}){state=s;elapsed+=dt;const operation=mode==='operation'||mode==='attract';field.root.visible=mode\"'!=='\"'story'&&mode\"'!=='\"'report';entities.visible=operation;tips.visible=operation;storyRoot.visible=mode==='story';stamps.visible=mode==='report';room.root.visible=true;portrait.visible=operation&&innerWidth/innerHeight>1.25&&s?.op\"'!==7;\n if(operation&&s){const op=operations[s.op]||operations[0],site=op.sites[s.site]?.organ||'\"'heart';if(site\"'!==currentSite){currentSite=site;field.reset(site);entityMap.forEach(v=>entities.remove(v.root));entityMap.clear();}field.update(s);\n for(const e of s.entities){let m=entityMap.get(e.id);if(!m){m=entityModel(e);entityMap.set(e.id,m);entities.add(m.root);}m.root.visible=e.site===s.site&&(!e.done||e.kind==='\"'bleeder'&&e.clamped||e.kind==='wound'&&e.done)&&(\"'!e.hidden||e.marked||e.scanned);m.root.position.set(e.x,field.height(e.x,e.y)+.015,-e.y);if(e.done&&e.kind==='\"'wound')m.root.scale.setScalar(.99);m.update?.(dt,s);}\n for(const [id,m] of entityMap)if(\"'!s.entities.some(e=>e.id===id)){entities.remove(m.root);entityMap.delete(id);}\n for(const seat of s.seats){let tip=tipMap.get(seat.id);if(!tip){const root=new T.Group(),r=ring(root,seat.color||'\"'#f2b134',0,.02,0,.075,.006);r.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;const dot=ball(root,'#fff5d5',0,.02,0,.012,.006,.012);tips.add(root);tip={root,ring:r,tool:-1,model:null};tipMap.set(seat.id,tip);}tip.root.visible=seat.site===s.site;tip.root.position.set(seat.x,field.height(seat.x,seat.y)+.045,-seat.y);if(tip.tool\"'!==seat.tool){if(tip.model)tip.root.remove(tip.model.root);tip.model=createInstrument(seat.tool);tip.root.add(tip.model.root);tip.tool=seat.tool;}tip.model.update(dt,seat.use);tip.ring.scale.setScalar(seat.use?.8:1);}\n for(const [id,m] of tipMap)if(!s.seats.some(t=>t.id===id)){tips.remove(m.root);tipMap.delete(id);}\n paddles.visible=s.arrest;if(s.arrest)paddles.position.set(0,field.height(0,0)+.02,0);\n setSpeaker(s.op===6?'\"'pip':'bea');portraitBust.expression(s.vitals<30?'wide':'neutral');portraitBust.talk(Math.sin(elapsed*12)>0?1:0);portraitBust.update(dt);\n for(const trophy of s.tray){const key='tray'+trophy.id;if(\"'!entityMap.has(key)){const m=entityModel({...trophy,kind:trophy.kind==='\"'adagio'?'tumor':trophy.kind,embed:0,cells:[]});m.root.position.set(trophy.x,.47+(s.tray.indexOf(trophy)%4)*.015,-trophy.y);m.root.scale.setScalar(.7);m.root.rotation.y=trophy.id*1.7;entities.add(m.root);entityMap.set(key,m);}}\n ink.u.danger.value=s.vitals<=30?1-s.vitals/40:0;hush=s.hush>0?Math.min(2,(settings.hushDuration||7)-s.hush+dt):Math.max(0,hush-dt*2);ink.u.hushRadius.value=hush;const p=project(s.seats[0]?.x||0,s.seats[0]?.y||0);ink.u.hushCenter.value.set(p.x/innerWidth,p.y/innerHeight);\n }else{paddles.visible=false;ink.u.danger.value=0;ink.u.hushRadius.value=0;}\n let target,look;\n const aspect=innerWidth/innerHeight;\n if(operation){const factor=aspect<16/9?(16/9)/aspect:1;target=new T.Vector3(.1,3.55*factor,1.65*factor);look=new T.Vector3(.05,.1,.06);if(aspect<1)target.y*=.85;}\n else if(mode==='story'){target=new T.Vector3(0,.2,8.7);look=new T.Vector3(0,-.1,0);if(aspect<1.3)target.z*=1.3/aspect;}\n else if(mode==='report'){target=new T.Vector3(2,3.5,2.7);look=new T.Vector3(0,0,0);}\n else{target=new T.Vector3(3.2,2.7,4.7);look=new T.Vector3(-.35,.8,-.3);if(aspect<1.2)target.z+=2;}\n if(shake>0&&settings.shake\"'!==false){target.x+=Math.sin(elapsed*83)*shake;target.z+=Math.cos(elapsed*67)*shake;}camera.position.lerp(target,mode==='\"'operation'?.3:.08);camera.lookAt(look);if(s?.pulse&&operation)camera.position.multiplyScalar(1+s.pulse*.001);\n room.mixer.update(dt);stampMixer.update(dt);for(const b of busts){b.update(dt);b.talk(Math.sin(elapsed*15)>0?1:0);}flash=Math.max(0,flash-dt*2);speed=Math.max(0,speed-dt*1.6);shake=Math.max(0,shake-dt*.2);ink.u.flash.value=flash;ink.u.speedLines.value=speed;ink.u.lineOn.value=settings.ink===false?0:1;ink.u.toneOn.value=settings.halftone===false?0:1;renderer.shadowMap.enabled=settings.shadows\"'!==false;\n if(particles.length){cosmeticWorld.step();for(let i=particles.length-1;i>=0;i--){const p=particles[i];p.life-=dt;if(p.life<=0){cosmeticWorld.removeRigidBody(p.b);particles.splice(i,1);}}particleMesh.count=particles.length;particles.forEach((p,i)=>{const a=p.b.translation();dummy.position.set(a.x,a.y,a.z);dummy.scale.setScalar(Math.min(1,p.life*3));dummy.updateMatrix();particleMesh.setMatrixAt(i,dummy.matrix);particleMesh.setColorAt(i,p.color);});particleMesh.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate=true;if(particleMesh.instanceColor)particleMesh.instanceColor.needsUpdate=true;}\n }\n let drawing=false;\n async function draw(){if(drawing||noRender)return;drawing=true;try{if(portrait.visible){renderer.setRenderTarget(portraitTarget);renderer.render(portraitScene,portraitCam);renderer.setRenderTarget(null);}await ink.post.renderAsync();}catch(e){onError(e);}finally{drawing=false;}}\n return{renderer,backend:renderer.backend.isWebGPUBackend?'\"'webgpu':'webgl2',update,draw,setMode,stage,speak,event,project,screenToField,ink,resize,dispose(){removeEventListener('resize',resize);renderer.dispose();cosmeticWorld.free();}};\n}\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_27","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > src/view/renderer.js <<'EOF'\nimport * as T from 'three/webgpu';\nimport RAPIER from '@dimforge/rapier3d-compat';\nimport {createInk} from './ink.js';\nimport {makeField} from './field.js';\nimport {mesh,box,ball,tube,ring,flatLabel,toon} from './materials.js';\nimport {createBust} from './bust.js';\nimport {createInstrument,makePaddles} from './instruments.js';\nimport {entityModel} from './entities.js';\nimport {operations} from '../data/ops/index.js';\nimport {cast} from '../data/cast.js';\nfunction makeRoom(scene){const room=new T.Group();scene.add(room);box(room,'#102d34',0,-.8,0,12,.15,12);box(room,'#1d4c52',0,2,-3.2,12,6,.2);\n for(let x=-5.5;x<=5.5;x+=.55)for(let y=-.5;y<4.6;y+=.55){box(room,(Math.round((x+5.5)/.55)+Math.round(y/.55))%4===0?'#245359':'#21494e',x,y,-3.07,.53,.53,.025);}\n for(const x of [-4.4,4.4]){box(room,'#15333e',x,1.1,-2.95,2.1,2.6,.1);box(room,'#102332',x,1.1,-2.85,1.95,2.4,.03);for(let i=0;i<9;i++)box(room,'#215461',x-.87+i*.22,1.05,-2.81,.012,2.3,.02);box(room,'#486f70',x,1.1,-2.79,2,.035,.02);}\n flatLabel(room,'ST. ALDER MEMORIAL',0,3.35,-2.93,4,.55,'#acc2ba');flatLabel(room,'OPERATING THEATRE  /  03',0,2.85,-2.91,3.5,.4,'#f2b134');\n const table=new T.Group();room.add(table);box(table,'#102f36',0,-.38,0,3.5,.3,2.15);box(table,'#5f8d8d',0,-.61,0,.7,.4,1.1);for(const x of [-1.45,1.45])box(table,'#9cbdba',x,-.25,0,.05,.07,2.2);\n const lamp=new T.Group();lamp.name='Lamp';lamp.position.set(.3,2.5,-.6);room.add(lamp);tube(lamp,'#9ebdb7',[[0,.08,0],[0,.7,0],[1.6,.7,0],[1.6,1.6,0]],.055);const shade=mesh(new T.CylinderGeometry(.55,.65,.15,12),'#90b8ae',lamp);shade.rotation.x=.15;const lightmat=new T.MeshBasicNodeMaterial({color:'#f8ecc5'});const disc=mesh(new T.CylinderGeometry(.56,.56,.025,32),lightmat,lamp,0,-.09,0);for(let i=0;i<6;i++){const a=i/6*Math.PI*2;ball(lamp,'#fff4d5',Math.cos(a)*.34,-.12,Math.sin(a)*.34,.13,.018,.13);}ring(lamp,'#153b43',0,-.12,0,.62,.025).rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;\n const mixer=new T.AnimationMixer(room);const action=mixer.clipAction(new T.AnimationClip('lamp swing',8,[new T.NumberKeyframeTrack('Lamp.rotation[z]',[0,2,4,6,8],[.025,0,-.025,0,.025])]));action.play();\n for(const x of [-2.5,2.8]){const monitor=new T.Group();monitor.position.set(x,.45,-1.6);room.add(monitor);box(monitor,'#0d202a',0,0,0,.88,.63,.19);box(monitor,'#b9c4ae',0,-.37,.01,.9,.07,.24);box(monitor,'#071923',0,0,.11,.73,.48,.025);tube(monitor,'#6de1c3',[[-.33,-.02,.14],[-.17,-.02,.14],[-.1,.02,.14],[-.05,-.17,.14],[.01,.19,.14],[.06,-.03,.14],[.33,-.02,.14]],.008);for(let i=0;i<3;i++)ball(monitor,i?'#567c73':'#f2b134',.33,-.2+i*.07,.13,.015);tube(monitor,'#829e95',[[0,-.4,0],[0,-1.12,0],[.3,-1.15,0]],.03);}\n return {root:room,lamp,mixer};}\nexport async function createView(container,{forceWebGL=false,noRender=false,onError=()=>{}}={}){\n const renderer=new T.WebGPURenderer({antialias:false,forceWebGL});renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,1.6));renderer.toneMapping=T.NoToneMapping;renderer.shadowMap.enabled=true;renderer.shadowMap.type=T.PCFSoftShadowMap;renderer.onDeviceLost=onError;await renderer.init();\n renderer.domElement.id='world';renderer.domElement.setAttribute('aria-label','Three-dimensional operating theatre');container.prepend(renderer.domElement);\n const scene=new T.Scene();scene.background=new T.Color('#0b2529');scene.fog=new T.Fog('#0b2529',9,24);\n const camera=new T.PerspectiveCamera(34,innerWidth/innerHeight,.1,60);scene.add(camera);\n const ambient=new T.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x819ba0,1.5);scene.add(ambient);const light=new T.DirectionalLight(0xfff2de,1.9);light.position.set(2.5,5,2);light.castShadow=true;light.shadow.mapSize.set(2048,2048);light.shadow.bias=-.0006;light.shadow.normalBias=.03;light.shadow.camera.left=-4;light.shadow.camera.right=4;light.shadow.camera.top=4;light.shadow.camera.bottom=-4;scene.add(light);\n const room=makeRoom(scene),field=makeField();scene.add(field.root);\n const entities=new T.Group(),tips=new T.Group(),storyRoot=new T.Group(),effects=new T.Group();scene.add(entities,tips,storyRoot,effects);\n const entityMap=new Map(),tipMap=new Map(),mixers=[];let currentSite='',mode='title',busts=[],speaker='bea',state=null,elapsed=0,flash=0,speed=0,hush=0,shake=0,lastPaint=0;\n const ink=createInk(renderer,scene,camera);\n const portraitScene=new T.Scene();portraitScene.background=new T.Color('#163f49');portraitScene.add(new T.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x6f8f96,2));const pl=new T.DirectionalLight(0xffe5c7,2);pl.position.set(2,3,4);portraitScene.add(pl);const portraitCam=new T.PerspectiveCamera(30,1,.1,20);portraitCam.position.set(0,-.2,5);portraitCam.lookAt(0,-.1,0);const portraitTarget=new T.RenderTarget(256,256);let portraitBust=createBust('bea');portraitScene.add(portraitBust.root);\n const pg=new T.PlaneGeometry(.29,.29);const uvs=pg.attributes.uv;for(let i=0;i<uvs.count;i++)uvs.setY(i,1-uvs.getY(i));const portrait=mesh(pg,new T.MeshBasicNodeMaterial({map:portraitTarget.texture,depthTest:false,depthWrite:false}),camera,0,-.43,-2);portrait.renderOrder=10;portrait.visible=false;\n const paddles=makePaddles();scene.add(paddles);paddles.visible=false;\n const stamps=new T.Group();scene.add(stamps);const clipboard=box(stamps,'#bf9c6c',0,.1,0,1.25,.06,1.65);const paper=box(stamps,'#f4f1e8',0,.14,0,1.12,.012,1.45);box(stamps,'#8baea9',0,.17,-.65,.45,.08,.12);const stamp=box(stamps,'#8d3a49',0,.9,0,.34,.18,.22);stamp.name='RankStamp';const stampMixer=new T.AnimationMixer(stamps);const stampAction=stampMixer.clipAction(new T.AnimationClip('stamp',.65,[new T.NumberKeyframeTrack('RankStamp.position[y]',[0,.24,.32,.43,.65],[1.2,1.2,.24,.3,.24])]));stampAction.setLoop(T.LoopOnce);stampAction.clampWhenFinished=true;stamps.visible=false;\n // A small view-only physics world supplies drops, sparks and thread follow-through.\n const cosmeticWorld=new RAPIER.World({x:0,y:-3.4,z:0});cosmeticWorld.timestep=1/60;const floor=cosmeticWorld.createRigidBody(RAPIER.RigidBodyDesc.fixed().setTranslation(0,-.06,0));cosmeticWorld.createCollider(RAPIER.ColliderDesc.cuboid(5,.03,5),floor);\n const particleMesh=new T.InstancedMesh(new T.SphereGeometry(.012,6,4),toon('#ffffff'),140);effects.add(particleMesh);const particles=[];const dummy=new T.Object3D();particleMesh.count=0;\n function burst(x,y,color,count=8){for(let i=0;i<count&&particles.length<140;i++){const b=cosmeticWorld.createRigidBody(RAPIER.RigidBodyDesc.dynamic().setTranslation(x,.35,-y).setLinvel(Math.cos(i*2.4)*.35,.2+i%3*.14,Math.sin(i*2.4)*.3));particles.push({b,life:.6+i*.02,color:new T.Color(color)});}}\n function resize(){const w=innerWidth,h=innerHeight;renderer.setSize(w,h);camera.aspect=w/h;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();const portraitX=w/h>1.4?-.32:-.18;portrait.position.set(portraitX,-.43,-2);}\n addEventListener('resize',resize);resize();\n const ray=new T.Raycaster(),mouse=new T.Vector2();\n function project(x,y,z){const v=new T.Vector3(x,z??field.height(x,y)+.05,-y).project(camera);return{x:(v.x+1)/2*innerWidth,y:(1-v.y)/2*innerHeight,visible:v.z<1};}\n function screenToField(x,y){mouse.set(x/innerWidth*2-1,1-y/innerHeight*2);ray.setFromCamera(mouse,camera);const p=new T.Vector3();let height=.2;for(let i=0;i<4;i++){ray.ray.intersectPlane(new T.Plane(new T.Vector3(0,1,0),-height),p);height=p.x>1.36?.45:field.height(p.x,-p.z);}return{x:p.x,y:-p.z};}\n function setSpeaker(id){if(id===speaker)return;speaker=id;portraitScene.remove(portraitBust.root);portraitBust.dispose();portraitBust=createBust(id);portraitScene.add(portraitBust.root);}\n function stage(data,line){mode='story';for(const b of busts)storyRoot.remove(b.root);busts=[];const ids=[...new Set(data.lines.map(l=>l.who))].slice(0,2);if(\"'!ids.includes(line.who))ids[1]=line.who;ids.forEach((id,i)=>{const b=createBust(id);b.root.position.set((i?1:-1)*1.62,.65,.1);b.root.scale.setScalar(.67);b.root.rotation.y=(i?-.15:.15);storyRoot.add(b.root);busts.push(b);});if(data.set==='\"'ward')scene.background.set('#15352f');else if(data.set==='lab')scene.background.set('#12303f');else scene.background.set('#0b2529');speak(line);}\n function speak(line){for(const b of busts){const active=b.spec.name===cast[line.who]?.name;b.expression(active?line.expression||'neutral':'neutral');if(active)b.animate(line.shout?'shock':'nod');}if(line.shout){speed=1;shake=.07;}}\n function event(e){if(e.type==='grade'){burst(e.x,e.y,e.grade==='MISS'?'#e8443a':'#f2b134',5);if(e.grade==='FLAWLESS')shake=.012;}if(e.type==='pop'||e.type==='deposit'){burst(e.x||1.6,e.y||.2,'#b8e5dc',8);}if(e.type==='hush'){hush=1;speed=1;}if(e.type==='sforzando'){flash=.45;speed=1;shake=.07;}if(e.type==='defib'){flash=1;shake=.09;speed=1;}if(e.type==='fortissimo'){speed=1;shake=.08;}if(['nick','scorch'].includes(e.type)&&elapsed-lastPaint>.06){field.paint(e.type,e.x,e.y);lastPaint=elapsed;}}\n function setMode(m){if(mode===m)return;mode=m;if(m==='report'){stampAction.reset().play();flash=.2;}}\n function update(s,dt,settings={}){state=s;elapsed+=dt;const operation=mode==='operation'||mode==='attract';field.root.visible=mode\"'!=='\"'story'&&mode\"'!=='\"'report';entities.visible=operation;tips.visible=operation;storyRoot.visible=mode==='story';stamps.visible=mode==='report';room.root.visible=true;portrait.visible=operation&&innerWidth/innerHeight>1.25&&s?.op\"'!==7;\n if(operation&&s){const op=operations[s.op]||operations[0],site=op.sites[s.site]?.organ||'\"'heart';if(site\"'!==currentSite){currentSite=site;field.reset(site);entityMap.forEach(v=>entities.remove(v.root));entityMap.clear();}field.update(s);\n for(const e of s.entities){let m=entityMap.get(e.id);if(!m){m=entityModel(e);entityMap.set(e.id,m);entities.add(m.root);}m.root.visible=e.site===s.site&&(!e.done||e.kind==='\"'bleeder'&&e.clamped||e.kind==='wound'&&e.done)&&(\"'!e.hidden||e.marked||e.scanned);m.root.position.set(e.x,field.height(e.x,e.y)+.015,-e.y);if(e.done&&e.kind==='\"'wound')m.root.scale.setScalar(.99);m.update?.(dt,s);}\n for(const [id,m] of entityMap)if(\"'!s.entities.some(e=>e.id===id)){entities.remove(m.root);entityMap.delete(id);}\n for(const seat of s.seats){let tip=tipMap.get(seat.id);if(!tip){const root=new T.Group(),r=ring(root,seat.color||'\"'#f2b134',0,.02,0,.075,.006);r.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;const dot=ball(root,'#fff5d5',0,.02,0,.012,.006,.012);tips.add(root);tip={root,ring:r,tool:-1,model:null};tipMap.set(seat.id,tip);}tip.root.visible=seat.site===s.site;tip.root.position.set(seat.x,field.height(seat.x,seat.y)+.045,-seat.y);if(tip.tool\"'!==seat.tool){if(tip.model)tip.root.remove(tip.model.root);tip.model=createInstrument(seat.tool);tip.root.add(tip.model.root);tip.tool=seat.tool;}tip.model.update(dt,seat.use);tip.ring.scale.setScalar(seat.use?.8:1);}\n for(const [id,m] of tipMap)if(!s.seats.some(t=>t.id===id)){tips.remove(m.root);tipMap.delete(id);}\n paddles.visible=s.arrest;if(s.arrest)paddles.position.set(0,field.height(0,0)+.02,0);\n setSpeaker(s.op===6?'\"'pip':'bea');portraitBust.expression(s.vitals<30?'wide':'neutral');portraitBust.talk(Math.sin(elapsed*12)>0?1:0);portraitBust.update(dt);\n for(const trophy of s.tray){const key='tray'+trophy.id;if(\"'!entityMap.has(key)){const m=entityModel({...trophy,kind:trophy.kind==='\"'adagio'?'tumor':trophy.kind,embed:0,cells:[]});m.root.position.set(trophy.x,.47+(s.tray.indexOf(trophy)%4)*.015,-trophy.y);m.root.scale.setScalar(.7);m.root.rotation.y=trophy.id*1.7;entities.add(m.root);entityMap.set(key,m);}}\n ink.u.danger.value=s.vitals<=30?1-s.vitals/40:0;hush=s.hush>0?Math.min(2,(settings.hushDuration||7)-s.hush+dt):Math.max(0,hush-dt*2);ink.u.hushRadius.value=hush;const p=project(s.seats[0]?.x||0,s.seats[0]?.y||0);ink.u.hushCenter.value.set(p.x/innerWidth,p.y/innerHeight);\n }else{paddles.visible=false;ink.u.danger.value=0;ink.u.hushRadius.value=0;}\n let target,look;\n const aspect=innerWidth/innerHeight;\n if(operation){const factor=aspect<16/9?(16/9)/aspect:1;target=new T.Vector3(.1,3.55*factor,1.65*factor);look=new T.Vector3(.05,.1,.06);if(aspect<1)target.y*=.85;}\n else if(mode==='story'){target=new T.Vector3(0,.2,8.7);look=new T.Vector3(0,-.1,0);if(aspect<1.3)target.z*=1.3/aspect;}\n else if(mode==='report'){target=new T.Vector3(2,3.5,2.7);look=new T.Vector3(0,0,0);}\n else{target=new T.Vector3(3.2,2.7,4.7);look=new T.Vector3(-.35,.8,-.3);if(aspect<1.2)target.z+=2;}\n if(shake>0&&settings.shake\"'!==false){target.x+=Math.sin(elapsed*83)*shake;target.z+=Math.cos(elapsed*67)*shake;}camera.position.lerp(target,mode==='\"'operation'?.3:.08);camera.lookAt(look);if(s?.pulse&&operation)camera.position.multiplyScalar(1+s.pulse*.001);\n room.mixer.update(dt);stampMixer.update(dt);for(const b of busts){b.update(dt);b.talk(Math.sin(elapsed*15)>0?1:0);}flash=Math.max(0,flash-dt*2);speed=Math.max(0,speed-dt*1.6);shake=Math.max(0,shake-dt*.2);ink.u.flash.value=flash;ink.u.speedLines.value=speed;ink.u.lineOn.value=settings.ink===false?0:1;ink.u.toneOn.value=settings.halftone===false?0:1;renderer.shadowMap.enabled=settings.shadows\"'!==false;\n if(particles.length){cosmeticWorld.step();for(let i=particles.length-1;i>=0;i--){const p=particles[i];p.life-=dt;if(p.life<=0){cosmeticWorld.removeRigidBody(p.b);particles.splice(i,1);}}particleMesh.count=particles.length;particles.forEach((p,i)=>{const a=p.b.translation();dummy.position.set(a.x,a.y,a.z);dummy.scale.setScalar(Math.min(1,p.life*3));dummy.updateMatrix();particleMesh.setMatrixAt(i,dummy.matrix);particleMesh.setColorAt(i,p.color);});particleMesh.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate=true;if(particleMesh.instanceColor)particleMesh.instanceColor.needsUpdate=true;}\n }\n let drawing=false;\n async function draw(){if(drawing||noRender)return;drawing=true;try{if(portrait.visible){renderer.setRenderTarget(portraitTarget);renderer.render(portraitScene,portraitCam);renderer.setRenderTarget(null);}await ink.post.renderAsync();}catch(e){onError(e);}finally{drawing=false;}}\n return{renderer,backend:renderer.backend.isWebGPUBackend?'\"'webgpu':'webgl2',update,draw,setMode,stage,speak,event,project,screenToField,ink,resize,dispose(){removeEventListener('resize',resize);renderer.dispose();cosmeticWorld.free();}};\n}\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
